<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Kumpipate</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kumpipate</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kumpipate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Ahab sih nung in Israelte tung ah Moabte a hel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah Samaria khua a dantan tungnung vathangkalh tohlet apan a kekhia a, a kihihnata hi. Huchi in mi a sawl a, a kiang uah, “Kuan unla, hiai ka natna a hoihkhe nawnthei hiam Ekron khaw pathian Baal zebub va dong un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa angel in Tishbi mi Elijah kiang ah, “Thou inla, Samaria kumpipa misawlte houpih din kuantou inla, a kiang uah, Israel gam a Pathian a omlouh ziak in hia Ekron khaw pathian Baal zebub dong dia na hong kuan uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Na kahtouna lupna apan na hong kumsuk nawn kei dia, na si ngeingei ding, chi’n vagen in” a chi hi. Huchi in Elijah a kuanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mi sawlte a kiang ah a hong kiknawn un a kiang uah, “Bang a chi a ahia na hong kiknawn mawk uh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, “Mi khat hong houpih din a hong a, ka kiang uah, Pai unla, nou hon sawlpa kumpipa kiang ah kiknawn unla, a kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Israel gam a Pathian a omlouh ziak in hia Ekron khaw pathian Baal zebub dong dia na sawl? Huchi in na kahtouhna lupna apan na hong kumsuk nawn kei ding a, na si ngeingei ding, chi’n va hilh un a honchi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Nou hon houpih dia hong, huai thute hong hilhpa mi bangchibang ahia oi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau a dawng ua, “Samul puan a kizem ahi a, a kawng savun kawnggak in a gak,” a chi ua; aman “Tishbi mi Elijah eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa’n sepaih sawmnga heutu, a heute sawmnga toh a kiang ah a sawl hi. A kiang ah a hohtou uhi. Huchi in ngai in, amah mualvum ah a na tu hi. Aman “Nang, Pathian mi, kumpipa’n hong paisuk in, a chi ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah in a dawng a, sepaih sawmnga heutu kiang ah, “Pathian mi ka hihleh van apan mei hong kesuk henla, nangmah leh na heute sawmnga hong kangmang vek hen” a chi hi. Huchi in van apan mei a hong kia a, amah leh a heute sawmnga a kangmang vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kiang ah sepaih sawmnga heutu dang, a heute sawmnga toh a sawlnawn hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Nang Pathian mi, kumpipa’n, hong paisuk meng in, a chi ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elijah in a dawng a, a kiang a ah, “Pathian mi ka hihleh van apan mei hong kesuk henla, nang leh na heute sawmnga hong kangmang vek hen” a chi hi. Huchi in Pathian mei van a kipan a hongkia a, amah leh a heute sawmnga a kangmang vekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sepaih sawmnga dang heutu, a heute sawmnga toh a sawl nawn a, huai sepaih sawmnga dang heutu a kuantou a, Elijah ma ah a va khukdin a, a kiang ah, “Pathian mi aw, ka hinna leh hiai na sikha mi sawmngate hinna na mitmuh in manpha hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai in, van apan mei a hong ke suk a, sepaih sawmnga heutu nihte a heute sawmnga u toh a kang mangta ua; huaiziak in ka hinna na mitmuh in manpha hen” chi’n a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa angel in Elijah kiang ah, “Kum suk pih in, amau lau ken” a chi hi. Huchi in a thou a, amah toh kumpipa kiang ah a kum suk khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Ekron khaw pathian Baal zebub dong dia mite na sawl, Israel gam a dot ding Pathian a omlouh ziak hia? Huaiziak in, na kahtouhna lupna apan na hong kumsuk nawn kei ding a, na si ngeingei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Elijah in a gen Toupa thu bang in a sita hi. Tapa a neih louh ziak in Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat tapa Jehoram kum nih a lal kum in Jehoram a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahaziah thilhih tanchin dangte Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Elijah pingpei a van a a pitouh din, hichi ahi a, Elijah, Elisha toh Gilgal apan a pawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elijah in Elisha kiang ah, “Hiai ah a na om dih; Toupa’n Bethel a pai din a honsawl hi” a chi hi. Elisha in, “ Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen hi. K’on nuse kei hial ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Bethel ah a paisuk khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethel a om zawlneite tapate Elisha kiang ah a hoh ua, a kiang ah, “Tuni’n Toupa’n na heutupa a hon lak mangsak ding chih na thei hia?” a chi uh. Aman, “He, theimah ing, dai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elijah in a kiang ah, “Elisha, hiai ah na om dih; Toupa’n Jeriko a hoh din a honsawl hi” a chi hi. Aman, “ Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen ahi. K’on nuse kei hial ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Jeriko ah a hoh khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeriko a om zawlneite tapate’n Elisha a va naih ua, a kiang ah, tuni’n Toupa’n na heutupa a honlak mangsak ding chih na thei hia? a chi uh. Aman a dawng a, “He, theimah ing; dai un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elijah in a kiang ah, “Hiai ah na om dih, Toupa’n Jordan a hoh din a honchi hi” a chi hi. Aman, “ Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen hi, k’on nuse kei hial ding” a chi hi. Huchi in a nih un a paikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zawlneite tapate lak a mi sawmnga a vahoh ua, amaute zawn ah gamla kuamtak ah a va ding ua; amau gel bel Jordan gei ah a na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elijah in a puan a la a, a lomzial a, tui a sat a, a langtuak ah a hong kikhenta a, huchi in a nih un leikeu ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A galkah nung un hichi ahi a, Elijah in Elisha kiang ah, “Na kiang apan lakmang a ka omma in bang ahia k’on hihsak ding hon ngen in” a chi hi; Elisha in “Na kha tan nih tang leng” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman “Thil haksapi ngen neive; haksa mahleh na kiang apan lakmang a ka omlai na muh leh na tang ding, n’on muh kei lehbel na tangkei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A paikawm kawm ua, a houlim lai un hichi ahi a, ngai in, mei kangtalai leh mei sakolte a hong kimu guih uhi. A kal ua kigolh in a kikhen sakta a; Elijah bel pingpei in van ah a paitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elisha in huai a mu a, “Ka pa aw, ka pa aw, Israelte kangtalai leh a sakol a tuangte aw!” chi in a kikou hi. Huchi in Elijah a muta kei a; amah puan a man a, phel nih in a botkek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah puan hong kia leng a tawm a, a pai kiknawn a, Jordan luigei ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elijah puan hong kia a la a, huai in tui a sat a, “ Toupa , Elijah Pathian koi ah?” a chi hi. Huchi a tui a sattakin a langtuak ah a hong kikhen a, Elisha a galkahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeriko khua a zawlneite tapate, amah zawn a omte’n a muh un, “Elijah kha Elisha tung ah a tumah ve” a chi uhi. Amah mu din a kuan ua, a ma ah leisi in a kunsuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau, a kiang ah, “Ngai in, na sikhate’n mi ngalhat pipi sawmnga ka ompih uh. Na heutupa zong din sawl ve. Toupa Kha in latou ahi dia, koilai tang ah hiam, koilai phaizang ah hiam a khia khattou ahimai ding” a chi uh. Aman, “Kuan sakken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zumhuai khop a a nget nung un, “Kuansak ve ua” a chi khong hi. Huchi in mi sawmnga a sawl ua; ni thum sung a zong ua, himahleh a mu zoukei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeriko khua a a nituanlai in a kiang ah a hong nawn ua; aman a kiang uah, na kiang uah, “Kuansak kei un, k’on chi ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai khua a mite’n Elisha kiang ah, “En in, hiai khomun a nuam mahmah a, ka toupa un leng n’on muhpih hi. Himahleh tui a hoihkei a, a gam mahmah gahsuah theilou gam ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman, “Tuithawl thak honla unla, chi thun un,” a chi a; huchi in a honla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuikhuk ah a vahoh a, chi a thehlut a, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi, hiai tui ka limsakta, tuban siah sihna leh gahsuahlouhna a om nawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Elisha gen bang in tunitan in huai tui a limta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai apan Bethel ah a hohtou a; lampi a a pailai in khua apan pasal naupang hon a hong pawtkhia ua, a hong nuihsan ua, a kiang ah, “Nang lugiaupa, va hohtou in, nang lugiaupa va hohtou in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nunglam a nga a, amau a mu a, Toupa min in a hamsiatta hi. Huchi in gamnuai apan vompinu nih a hong pawtkhia ua, a lak ua naupang sawmli leh nih a balgawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai apan Karmel tang ah a hoh a, huai apan Samaria khua ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat kum sawmlehgiat a lal kum in Ahab tapa Jehoram Israelte tung ah Samaria khua ah a lal pan a; kum sawmlehnih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihloupi a hih a; himahleh a nu leh a pa bangtel in zaw thil ahihkei hi. Ama’n a pa Baal suangphuh a paimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh, Israelte thil hihkhial sak Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhnate amah ah a belh chinten a; huai a paisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab kumpipa Mesha belam vulmi ahi a; aman Israel kumpipa kiang ah belamnou nuai khat mul leh belampa nuai khat mul siah a liau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Ahab sih nung in hichi ahi a, Moab kumpipa Israel kumpipa tung ah a helta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchihlai in kumpipa Jehoram Samaria khua apan a pawt a, Israel tengteng a kai khawmvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a pawt a, Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat kiang ah “Moab kumpipa ka tung ah a hel a, Moabte na hondou pih diam?” chi in mi a sawl hi. Aman “Hondou pih e, kei leh nang, ka mite leh na mite pumkhat i hi ua, ka sakolte leh na sakolte leng pumkhat ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amahmah in, “Koi lampi ah ahia i kuan touh ding?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Edom gamdai lampi ah” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa Judah kumpipa toh, Edom kumpipa toh, a kuanta ua; ni sagih a paikual ua; a sepaihte leh a gan tonpihte dawn ding tui a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n, “E heh he! Toupa’n kumpipa thumte Moabte khut a piak dia hon pikhawm ahi peuhmah ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Jehosaphat in, “Hiai ah Toupa hon dotsak ding Toupa zawlnei kuahiam bek a omkei maw?” a chi hi. Israel kumpipa sikha khat in a dawng a, “Elijah khut tui buaksekpa Saphat tapa Elisha hiai a om eive,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehosaphat in, a kiang ah “Aman Toupa thu a nei hi” a chi hi. Huchi in Israel kumpipa leh Jehosaphat leh Edom kumpipa a kiang ah a hoh sukta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha in Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “Nang leh ken kizopna bang i nei a? Na pa zawlneite leh na nu zawlneite kiang ah vahoh in” a chi hi. Israel kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Pailou e; kumpipa thumte Moabte khut a piak din Toupa’n a hon pikhawm hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha in, “A kiang a ka dinna sepaihte Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi. Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat zahtaklou hileng nanglam leng ka nga kei dia, muh leng k’on mu hetkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh, kaihging tumsiam mi honsam un” a chi hi. Kaihging tumsiam in a hontum leh, hichi ahi a, Toupa khut a tung ah a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Hiai phaizang tengteng toukuak tektuk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa mah in hichi in a chi. Huih himhim na mu kei ding ua, vuah himhim leng na musam kei ding uh. Himahleh hiai phaizang tui in a dim vek ding hi. Huchi in nou leh na bawnghonte uh leh na gante un a dawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai Toupa ngaih in thil neuchik lel ahi a; Moabte na khut uah a honpiak behlap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kulhpi nei khua tengteng leh khopi hoih tengteng na hihse ding ua, sing hoih tengteng na phuk ding ua, tuikhuk tengteng na hubing ding ua, mun hoih tata suang in na dengse vek ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zingsang in, thillat lat hunlai in hichi ahi a, ngai in, Edom gam lam apan tui a hongluang a, a gam tui in a hong dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moab tengteng in amau sual din kumpipate a hong kuantou uh chih a na zak un, galdou thei chiang tengteng a na kikaikhawm ua, gamgi ah a na pangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in, zingkhang in a thou ua, ni in tui tung a hon salvak a, Moabte’n a zawn ua tui sisan bang a san in a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sisan eive, kumpipate amau le amau a kidou ua, amau leh amau kithat uh ahi mahmah ve. Kisa un, Moabte aw, gallak thil i vatuh ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israelte giahphual a vatun uleh, Israelte a hong thouphut ua, Moabte a sual ua, huchi in a ma uah a taikek uh. Moabte that kawm in a gam uah a delhlutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuate a hihsia ua; amun hoih tata teng uh michih in a deng ua, suang in a dimgawpta hi. Tuikhuk tengteng a hubing ua, sing hoih tengteng a phuk ua; Kir hareseth khua a om suangte kia a khoihkei uhi. Huai leng vaisuanglot tawipawl in a um kimvel ua, a sual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab kumpipa’n a kidou uh zou din a kitheita kei a, Edom kumpipa kiang a tungdia phut paisuak tum in namsau tawi mi za sagih a pikhia a, himahleh a lohsam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in a tapa upapen, a sik a honglal ding pen kulhdawn ah haltum thillat in a lanta hi. Huchi in Israelte a tung ah a heh mahmah ua, a kisa ua, a gam uah a paikik nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, zawlneite tapate zite lak a numei khat in Elisha kiang ah, “Na sikha, ka pasal a na sita hi. Na sikha in Toupa a lau chih na thei a; a leibat napa’n ka tate a nih ua sikha dia pi din a hong kuan hi” chi in a mangbat thu a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elisha in a kiang ah, “Bang k’on hihsak dia? Honhilh ve, inn ah bang na nei a?” a chi hi. Aman Na sikhanu’n “Sathau um khat kia loungal inn ah bangmah ka neikei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in aman, vakuan inla, na invengte tengteng bel vuak va khel khawm in; tamlou kia zaw khel ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na honglut chiang in na tate toh kong kikhak khum unla, huai bel tengteng ah sathau thun inla; a dim dim in na tuamkoih ding“ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang apan a paita a, amah leh a tapate toh kong a kikhak khum ua; amau belte a honla ua, aman a na thunzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Belte a dim nung in, hichi ahi a, a tapa kiang ah, “Bel honla nawn dih” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah “Bel a om nawn kei” a chi hi. Huchi in sathau a kangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaikhit in Pathian mi kiang ah a vahoh a, thil omdan a va hilh hi. Aman, “Vapai inla, sathau vazuak inla, na leibat va din inla, a val in na tapate toh khosa un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat Elisha Shunem khua ah a vazin hi. Huai ah numei neizoutak khat a om hi. Aman an ne din a na sawl teitei hi. Huchi in a pai peuhmah chiang in huai ah an ne din a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a pasal kiang ah, “Ngai in, hiai mi honnawk zelpa Pathian Mi Siangthou ahi, chih ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kisa dih, in pindan neu i bawlsak dia, lupna, dohkan, tutphah leh khawnvak koihna i koihsak ding. Huchi a i kiang a a hong chiang in a lutzel ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat a vahoh a, huai in pindan ah a valut a, a valum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sikha Gehazi kiang ah, “Hiai Shunem numei honsam dih” a chi hi. A vasama maah a hongding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Ngai in, Nang nakpitak in n’on deihthoh a, bang k’on hihsak sam dia, kumpipa hiam, sepaih heutu hiam hon houpihsak leng na ut hia? chi’n a kiang ah gen in” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Ka chipihte lak maha teng ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman “Amah a dia bang hihding ahia leh?” a chi hi. Gehazi in a dawng a, “Tapa zaw a neikei hi, a pasal lah a upata hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman, “Vasam dih,” a chi hi. A va sam a, kongah a hongding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman, “Tu bang hun a hong tun nawn chiang in tapa na pomta ding” a chi hi. Aman, “Maizen, toupa, nang Pathian min na sikhanu kiang ah zuaugen ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in numei a gai a, Elisha in a kiang a, a gen bang a ahun a hongtun nawn in tapa a neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naungek a hong khanglian a, ni khat a pa toh buhla mite kiang ah a kuansam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pa kiang ah, “Ka lu, ka lu” a chi hi. A pa’n sikha valnou khat kiang ah, “A nu kiang ah pom in paipihin” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A paipiha, a nu kiang a tunin a pheitung ah suntan a tu a, huchi in a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A paitoua, Pathian mi lupna ah a siala, kong a khakkhum a, a pawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in a pasal a sam a, “Sikha kuahiam leh sabiltung khat hon ngaihtuahsak dihve, Pathian mi kiang ah ka vatai dia, k’ong kiknawn ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman “Bangdia tuni chitchiata a kiang a hohtum na hia? Kha thak leng ahikeia, khawlni leng ahi ngalkeia” a chi hi. Aman, “A hoih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in sabiltung a bawl a, a sikha kiang ah, “Hawl inla malam ah pai in, thu k’on piak kei leh awl paiken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in a paita hi, Pathian mi kiang ah Karmel tangah a vahoh hi. Pathian min gamlapi apan a na muh in, hichi ahi a, a sikha Gehazi kiang ah, “En in, huai ah Shunem numei a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah dawn din vatai inla, a kiang ah, na dam hia? Na pasal dam maw? Naupang leng dam maw? va chi in” a chi hi. Aman a na dawng a, “Dam e” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tang a Pathian mi kiang a va tun in, a khe a len chinten a, amah hong sawnhang tum in Gehazi in a va naih hi. Himahleh Pathian mi’n “Bangmah chih ken, a lungsim a mangbang hi. Toupa’n ka lak ah a sel a a honhilh naikei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in aman, “Ka toupa, tapa k’on ngen ahia? Honkhem ken, k’on chi hilou maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Gehazi kiang ah, “Na puan teng inla, ka chiang tawi in vahoh in. Kuapeuh mu lechin leng, chibai buk ken. Kuapeuh in chibai a honbuk uleh leng dawng ken. Ka chiang naupang maitang ah vanga in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Naupang nun, “ Toupa hinna leh na hinna lou in ka gen hi, k’on khah hetkei ding” a chi hi. Huchi in a thou a, a zuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazi in amau a na makhelha, naupang mai ah chiang a na nga hi. Himahleh aw leh zak bangmah a omkei. Huchi in houpih din a kiknawn a, “Naupang hak hetkei veh aw” chi’n a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisha insung a va lut leh ngai in, naupang a si khinta a, a lupna ah a na lumsak lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huchi in a valut a, a nih un kong a khakkhum a, Toupa kiang ah a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A paitou a, naupang a bohkhuma, a muk leh a muk, a mit leh a mit, a khut leh a khut a sutuaha; a tung ah a kizana; huchi in naupang taksa a honglum hiaihiai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in a kiknawn a, inn sung ah a kivialleh a; a hohtoua, a tung ah a bok a; huchi in naupang sagihvei a hong hahchiai a, a hong hakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in Gehazi a sam a, “Hiai Shunem numei honsam dih” a chi hi. A vasam a, a kiang a a valut leh, “Na tapa pom in” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in a valut a, a khebul ah a khupboh a, a mai a leisi in a kuna; a tapa a pom a, a pawtkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gilgal ah Elisha a hohnawn hi. Huai gam ah kial a kia hi. zawlneite tapate a ma ah a tukhawm ua; aman a sikha kiang ah, “Bel lianpi suang inla, zawlneite tapate an huansakin” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi khat gam ah meh zong in a vakuana, gam khau a va mua, a gah khenkhat a lou a, a puan in a tun theihzah a tun a, a atnena, bel sung ah a kha hi. Bang ahia chih a thei kuamah a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huchi in huai mite nek din a suakkhia ua, an huan a nek ua leh, hichi ahi a, “E, Pathian mi, bel sung a sihna om a kei maw” a chi kheukhou ua; a ne theita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aman, “Tangbuang hon ladih ua” a chi a; huai bel ah a kha hi; “Mite nek din hon suakkhe dih ua” a chi hi. Huchi in bel ah lauhuai bangmah a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Baal Shalisha apan mi khat a hong a, Pathian mi adin buh thak masapen a bawl barli buh sangpek sawmnih leh buh thak vui a ip in a hontawi a; aman, “Hiai mite nekdin pia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sikha in, “Bang e, mi za khattak hiai ka lui ding maw?” a chi hi. Aman hiai mite nekding pia in. Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “A ne ding ua, a khamval lai ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi in a lui a, a ne ua, Toupa chih bang ngei in a khamval lai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suria kumpipa sepaih heutu Naaman, Toupa’n Suriate humbitpa a a zat ziak in, a pu ngaih in thupi leh zahtakhuai tak ahi. Amah mi hat ahi lai a, himahleh a phak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suriate a pawlpawl in a kuan khia ua, Israel gam apan numei naupangnou khat sal in a honpi ua; aman Naaman zi na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman a pi kiang ah, “Ka toupa Samaria khua a zawlnei kiang a om hileh chi nang e! A phakna a na hihdamsak ding hi a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi khat a valut a, a toupa kiang ah, “Israel gam a numei naupang nou in huchibang khachi bang in a gen” chi in a pu a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria kumpipa’n “Vahoh hen aw, Israel kumpipa kiang ah lai ka khak ding” a chi hi. Huchi in a pawt a, dangkasik talent sawm leh, dangkaeng khal sang guk leh silhlehten kikhenna ding sawm a keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huailai in Israel kumpipa a vapia a, huai ah hiai a kigelh hi. “Hiai lai na mu dia, ngai in, ka sikha Naaman a phakna na hihdam sak din na kiang ah k’on sawl hi” chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n huailai a sim a, hichi ahi a, a puan a botkek a, “Mite that thei a, hingsak nawn thei Pathian hia ka hih? Hiai mi in phak hihdam dia ka kiang ah a honsawl mawkmawk. Ngaihtuah unla, ka tung ah thusia a zong hi, chih theidih ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian mi Elisha in Israel kumpipa’n a puan a botkek chih a na zak in, hichi ahi a, “Bangdia na puan botkek na hia? Ka kiang ah hongpai leh a ke, huchi in Israel gam ah zawlnei a om chih a theimai ding” va chi din kumpipa kiang ah mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Naaman a sakolte leh a kangtalaite toh a vahoh a, Elisha inn kongbul ah a va ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in, “Jordan lui ah sagihvei va kisil inla, na sa in ngeina a pu nawn dia, huchi in na siangta ding” chi din mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh, Naaman a heh mahmah a, a paikhia a, “Ngai un, amah mah ka kiang a hongpawt dia, a hongding dia, Toupa a Pathian min a sam dia, ka phakna tung ah a khut a koih dia, ka phak damsak ding eive, chimah hiveng in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaska khaw luite Abana leh Pharpar Israel gam lui tengteng sang in a hoihzaw ka hia? Huaite a kisil in ka siangthou theikei dia hia?” a chi hi. Huchi in a kilehhei a, heh mahmah in a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sikhate’n a vanaih ua, a va houpih ua, “Ka pa aw, zawlnei in thil haksatak hon hihsak dek lehleng na hihmai kei dia hia? Va kisil inla, hong siangthou in, a chih pen hihzawk tuaklua hilou maw?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a hohsuk a, Pathian mi gen bang in Jordan lui ah sagihvei a va kidiaha; huchi in a sa naungek sa bang a hong hinawn a, a hongsiangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah leh a heu tengteng Pathian mi kiang ah a kiknawn ua, a ma ah a va ding uhi. Aman “Ngai in, Israel ah loungal leitung tengteng ah Pathian a na omkei, chih ka theita. Huaiziak in, tuin na sikha vualzawlna la din k’on ngen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh aman “A kiang a ka omna Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi. Bangmah ka lakei ding” a chi hi. Huchi in aman la din a ngen a; himahleh a la utkei bikbek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naaman in, “Ahihkeileh, kei na sikha sabiltung nih puak khop leitang hon lasak in. Tuban siah kei na sikha in Toupa kiang kia ah ngallou haltum thillat leh kithoihna himhim pathian dangte kiang ah ka lan nawn hetkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiai thil ah Toupa’n na sikha ngaidam hen. Rimmon inn a be dia ka ban a kingai a ka toupa a lut chiang a, keileng ka kunsam a ngaih chiang in Toupa’n hon ngaidam hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Lungmuangtakin pai in” a chi hi. Huchi in a kiang apan a pawt a, gamla lou a paikhe man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian mi Elisha sikha Gehazi in, “Ngai in, ka pu in Suria mi Naaman thil hontawite la hetlou in a paisak mawka. Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi, ka vadelh dia, a neih banghiam bek ka vala ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Gehazi in Naaman a delhta hi. Naaman in kuahiamin a delh a muh in, na houpih din kangtalai apan a kumkhia hi. “Hoihvek na maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman, “Hoihvek mah e. Ka pu in, Ngai in, tumah in Ephraim tang gam apanin zawlneite tapate lak a tangval nih ka kiang ah a hong ua, amaute dangkasik talent khat leh puansilh kikhenna ding nih pia in” chih gen ding in a hongsawl hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naaman in, “ Khamuang inla, Talent nih lave” a chi hi. Huchi in ladin a ngen a, dangkasik talent nih puansilh kikhenna ding nih toh ip nih ah a thuna, a sikhate nih a pawsaka, a ma ah a paipihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tang a vatun un a laksaka, inn sung ah a koih a; huchi in mite a paisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah a lut a, a pu ma ah a va ding hi. Elisha in a kiang ah, “Koi a hong kipan na hia, Gehazi?” a chi hi. Aman, “Na sikha koimah ah ka hohkei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Nang mu dia kangtalai apan huai mi a hong kumlai in ka lungtang na kiang ah a paikei maw? Sum, puansilhte, olive huante, grephuante, belamte, bawngtalte, sikhapate leh sikhanute lakhun ahi ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Naaman phak nang ah a belh dia, tangtawn in na suante ah leng a belh ding” a chi hi. Huchi in a omna apan vuk bang a ngouin phaksa in a paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, zawlneite tapate’n Elisha kiang ah, “En in, hiai mun na kiang a ka tenna uh kou adin a kawchik lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />K’on ngen uh. Jordan lui ah kahoh suk ding ua, huai ah sing ka vala chiat ding ua, ka tenna ding uh huai ah ka valam ding uh aw?” a chi uhi. Aman a dawng a, “Kuan ve ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat in, “Na sikhate kiang ah hohsam in” a chi hi. Aman, “Hohsam leng a kei dia” chi’n a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang uah a hohsamta hi. Jordan lui a tun un sing a phuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in a phuk sanlai in, a heitang tui ah a kia hi. Aman, “Maizen! Pu, mi a kikhel eive” chi’n a kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian mi in “Koilai ah ahia a kiak?” a chi hi. Aman a kiakna mun a ensak hi. Huchi in sing hiang khat a sat a, huai ah a pailut a, sik a hong kilam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman, “Tawm aw leh” a chi a; huchi in a sawk a, a tawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria kumpipa’n Israelte a hong dou a, huai mun ah giahphual ka sat ding, chi’n a sikhate thu a kum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian mi’n Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “Huchibang mun a hoh lou din pilvang in. Huai ah Suriate a hongsuk ding uh” chi’n mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Pathian mipa’n a na hilhna mun mi a va enkhesak zel hi. Huai ah nihvei khatvei phetlou in, a na kihumbit zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in huai thu ah Suria kumpipa lungtang a mangbang gawp hi. A sikhate a sam a, a kiang uah, “I lak ua mi a kua ahia Israel kumpipa lam a pang? N’on hilh kei ding ua hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sikhate lak a mi khat in, “Kuamah pang kei ve ung e, kumpipa, ka toupa aw. Israel gam a om zawlnei Elisha in na dantan sunggil a na gente Israel kumpipa a na hilh zel ahizaw hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, “Koi a om ahia va zong un, ka va mansak ding” a chi hi; “Ngai in, Dothan ah a om” chi’n a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in sakolte, kangtalaite leh sepaih tampite huai ah a sawl a, zan in a vahoh ua, khua a um kim vel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian mi sikha zingkhang in a thou a, a va pawt khiak leh, ngai in, sepaihte’n sakol leh kangtalaite toh khua a na umsuakta uh. Sikha in a kiang ah, “Maizen! Pu aw, bang i chihta dia le?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman, “Lau ken; amau lam a pangte sang in ei lam a pangte a tam zaw hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Elisha a thum a, “ Toupa , a muh theihna din a mit vaksak in” a chi hi. Toupa’n huai tangval mit a vaksak a; huchi in a mu samta a; ngai in, Elisha kimvel a mualte mei kangtalai leh sakol in a dim vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah lam a a hong paisuk uleh Toupa kiang ah Elisha a thum a, “Hiai mite mit tawsak in” a chi hi. Huchi in Elisah thu bang in a mit uh a tawsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisha in a kiang uah, “Hiai lampi ahi kei, hiai leng khua ahi sam kei. Kei honzui un, na mi zonpa uh kiang ah k’on pi ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Samaria khua ah a pita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samaria khaw sung a tun un hichi ahi a, Elisha in, “ Toupa , hiaite’n a muh theihna ding un a mit uh vaksak in” a chi hi. Huchi in Toupa a mit uh a vaksak a, a muta ua; ngai in, Samaria khaw sung ah a na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n amau a muh in Elisha kiang ah, “Ka Pa aw, ka that diam? Ka that diam?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “That ken; na namsau leh na thalpeu in na salmatte na that dia hia? Tanghou leh tui a ma uah lui inla, ne in dawn uhenla, a pu uh kiang ah pai kiknawn uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in nekding thupi mahmah a bawlsak a; a nek ua a dawn khit un a paisak vek ua, a pu uh kiang lam ah a pai nawn uh. Huchi in Suria pawlte Israel gam ah a hong nawnta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai nung in hichi ahi a, Suria kumpipa Benhadad in a sepaih tengteng a kaikhawm a, Samaria khua a va umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Samaria khua ah kial a nasa mahmah a, ngai in, sabiltung lutang dangka sawmgiat in a khot uh leh begap kab mun li a khen mun khat dangka nga a lei ahihtan hial un, khua a um bikbek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel kumpipa kulhdawn a a pailai in numei khat in, Aw kumpipa, ka toupa, honhuh in, chi’n a na sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman, “ Toupa’n a hon panpih ngal kei leh ken koi apan in ahia k’on panpih ding? Buhphual ahihkeileh grep sukna khuk apan in maw?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Bang na chi a ahia awi?” a chi nawn hi. Aman a dawng a, “Hiai numei in ka kiang ah, Tuni in na tapa i nek din hon thoh ve, zingchiang in ka tapa i ne na keidia, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in ka tapa ka huan ua, ka ne uh. A zing in ken a kiang ah, Na tapa i nek din hon thohsam in, ka chi hi. Aman a tapa a selgu maimah hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa’n numei thugen a zak in hichi ahi a, a puan a botkek a; kulh dawn a a pailai ahi a; mipite’n a et uleh, ngai in, a sa tung ah saiip puan a na silh nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in aman, “Tuni a Saphat tapa Elisha in a lutang a puak lai peuhmah leh Pathian in a lohloh in honloh mai hen, huai sang a leng thupizaw in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisha a inn ah a tu a, upate leng a kiang ah a tu sam uh. Kumpipa’n a kiang ah mi khat a sawl a, himahleh a misawl a kiang a tun ma in upate kiang ah, “Hiai tualthatpa tapa in ka lu la din mi a honsawl, chih na thei na uhia? Pau kei dih ua, a misawl a hongtun chiang in, kong na khak unla, kongkhak in na dal bikbek un. A nung ah a pu kalsuan ging a kiza kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huchi a amau a houpih sanlai in, ngai in, a mi sawl a hong tungsuk hi. Ngai in, kumpipa’n “Hiai thil hoihlou Toupa honsawl ahi; Toupa bangdi’n ka hungaih lailai dia?” chi ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elisha in, “ Toupa thu na za un. Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Zingchiang hiai hun ding vel in Samaria kulh kongpi bul ah tangbuang nel tehna khat sekel khat in a khong ding ua, barli buh tehna nih sekel khat in” chi’n, a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heutu khat kumpipa’n a khut a ngaknapa’n Pathian mi a dawng hi. “Ngai in, Toupa’n van ah tohlette bawl leh leng hiai bang ahi thei mahmah dia hia?” a chi hi. Aman, “Ngai in, na mit in na mu dia, himahleh na nekei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huailai in kulh lutna kongpi bul ah phak li a om uhi. Amau, “Bangdia sih ngak lel a tu nilouh i hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khopi sung ah lutni, chi leng, khopi sung kial a, huai a vasi mai ding hang a; hiai ah tu nilouh le hang lah, si thouthou ding hang a; huaiziak in tuin paini, Suria sepaihte kiang ah i valut peuhmah ding uh. A hon na hinghawi uh leh i hing dia; a hon na thah uh leh si i hi maike” chi’n a kihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Suriate giahphual a hoh din khomui in a kuan uhi. Suriate giahphual tuah masak a vatun un, ngai in, kuamah a na omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n Suria sepaihte kangtalaite husa, sakolte husa leh sepaih tampi husa a na zasak hi. Huchi in, “Ngai un, Israel kumpipa’n Hit kumpipate leh Aigupta kumpipate ei hong dou dia guai eive” chi’n a kihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a thou ua, khomui in a taikekta uh. A puaninte uh, a sakolte uh, a sabiltungte uh leh a giahphual uh a om ngeingei in a taisan ua, a taikekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai mi phakte giahphual tuah masak a vatun un puanin khat ah a lut ua, ne in a dawn uh. Dangkasik, dangkaeng leh puansilhte a la ua, a sel ua; a nung kiknawn ua, puanin dang ah a lut nawn ua, huai a leng a la ua, a sel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A denchiang in, i hihdik hetkei. Tuni tanchin kipahhuai tun ni ahi a, ei i daidide ua; khovak i ngak uleh gawtna i tuak ding uh. huaiziak in, kisa ni, kumpipa inkawte i va hilh ding uh” chi’n a kihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in khopi kongkhak vengmi a va sam ua; “Suriate giahphual ah ka va hoh ua, ngai in, kuamah a na omkei ua, mihing husa himhim leng a omkei, sakolte leh sabiltungte kia a na kikhih a, puaninte leng a om ngeingei in a na om uhi” chi’n a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kongkhak vengmite a sam a; amau kumpipa inn sung a mite a vahilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa zan in a thou a, a sikhate kiang ah, “Suriate hon bawldan k’on hilh ding. I gilkial dan uh a thei uh. Huaiziak in, khopi apan a hongpawt uleh a hing in i na man ding ua, khaw sung ah i lut ding uh, chi in gamlak a kibu dia a giahphual uh pawt khiak san ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sikhate lak a khat in a dawng a, “Khopi a omsun sakol nga va pisak inla, ngai in, Israel mipi a damlai tengteng Israel mipite si bang a sehte ahi himhim uhi; huchi in amaute sawl in enkhia ni” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in kangtalai kai sakol nih a pi ua; kumpipa’n, “Va en dih ua” chi’n, Suria sepaihte delh din a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jordan lui pha in a vadelh ua; ngai in, Suriate’n a kin ziak ua a paih uh puansilhte leh vante lamtawn in a om zelzul hi. Huchi in a mi sawlte a hong kiknawn ua, kumpipa a honghilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in mipi a pawtkhia ua, Suriate giahphual a valok uhi. Huchi in Toupa thu bang ngei in tangbuang nel tehna khat Sekel khat in a khong ua, barli buh tehna nih Sekel khat mah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa’n sepaih heutu, a khut a ngakpa kulh kongpi vengmi in a sep hi. Mipite’n a kulh kongpi bul ah a chil uhi, Pathian mi’n a kiang a kumpipa a hong paisuklai a, a na gen bang in a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Pathian mi’n kumpipa kiang a, Zingchiang hichih hun ding vel in Samaria kulh kongpi bul ah “Barli buh tehna nih Sekel khat in a khong ding ua, tangbuang nel tehna khat sekel khat mah in,” a chih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />sepaih heutu in Pathian mi dawng a, “Ngai in, Toupa’n van ah tohlette bawl leh leng, huchibang ahi thei dia hia?” a chih a, aman, “Ngai in, na mit in na mu ngei dia, himahleh na ne kei ding” a chih bang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchibang in a tung ah a hongtungta hi; mipi’n kulh kongpi bul ah a chil ua, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Elisha in a tapa a hihdamsak numei kiang ah, “Thou inla, nang leh na inkawte na om theihna munmun uah va kialtai tadih un. Toupa’n lah kial a kesak ngal a, hiai gam ah kum sagih sung kial a ke ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in numei a thou a, Pathian mi thugen bang in a hih a; a inkawte toh Philistiate gam ah kum sagih a va kialtai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sagih a hong kivei nung in hichi ahi a, huai numei Philistiate gam apan a kiknawn a; a inn leh lou ngen din kumpipa a zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Pathian mi sikha Gehazi a houpih a, “Elisha in thil thupi a hih tengteng honhilh dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sisa mi khat a hinsak nawn thu kumpipa a na hilhlaitakin hichi ahi a, ngai in, a tapa a hinsak nawn numei in a inn leh lou kumpipa kiang ah a hong ngen hi. Gehazi in, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, hiai numei ahi, hiai ahi a tapa, Elisha in a hinsak nawn” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa’n numei a dot leh a hilh hi. Huchi in kumpipa’n heutu khat a sehsak a, “Amah a tengteng, a lou a thilpiang tengteng tan in, hiai gam a pawt khiak san apan tuni tan a teng penawn vek un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elisha Damaska khua ah a hoh a; Suria kumpipa Benhadad a chi a na hi. “Pathian mi hiai ah a hongve” chi’n a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Hazael kiang ah, “Thilpiak tawi inla, Pathian mi houpih din vahoh inla, ka chinatna apan ka hoih khenawn thei diam, Toupa hon na dotsak leh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hazael amah houpih din a kuan a, thilpiak ding Damaska khua a thil hoih chiteng, sangawngsau sawmli puak khop a tawi a, a ma ah a va ding a, “Na tapa Benhadad, Suria kumpipa in, ka chinatna apan ka hoih khenawn diam chidin na kiang ah kei a honsawl hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in a kiang ah, “Pai nawn inla, a kiang ah, na hoihkhe nawn na mah ke, a chi ve, va chi in. Himahleh a taktak in bel a si ngeingei ding chih, Toupa’n a hon theisak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in amah adia zumhuai khop in Elisha in a ensal gegu a; huchi in Pathian mi a kapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hazael in, “Bangdia ka toupa kap ahia?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Israel suante tung a na thil hoihlou hih ding ka theih ziak in ahi. A kulhte uh na hal dia, a tangvalte uh namsau in na that dia, a tanu neu chikchikte na paizan dia, naupai lai a numeite uh na pik kek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hazael in, “Kei na sikha ui leltak in hiai thil thupi hihthei ding ka hi mahmah ahia?” a chi hi. Elisha in a dawng a, “Suriate tung ah na honglal ding chih Toupa’n a hon theisak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Elisha kiang apan a pawt a, a pu kiang ah a paita hi. Aman, “Elisha in bang a hon na hilh a?” a chi hi. Aman, “Na hoih khenawn na tham ding, chi in a honhilh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zing in hichi ahi a, puansahpi khat a la a, tui ah a diah a, a mai a khuhsak a, huchi in a sita a; a sik in Hazael a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab tapa Joram kum nga a lal kum in huailai in Jehosaphat bel Judah kumpipa ahi, Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat tapa Jehoram a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lal patlai in kum sawmthum leh nih a upa ahi a; Jerusalem khua ah kum giat vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahab inkawte bang in, Israel kumpipate lampi tot a tawn a; Ahab tanu zi in a nei hi. Huchi in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihloupi a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n a sikha David ziak in Judah gam a hihse nuamkei a, a suante tan a khawnvak neihsak gige a na chiamtak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A damlai in Judahte tung ah Edomte a hel ua, a tung ua kumpipa ding a ki bawltawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Joram bel Zair ah kangtalai tengteng toh a hoh hi. Zan in a kisa khia a, amau um Edomte leh a kangtalai tung ua heutute a va sualta hi. Huchi in mite a puaninte uah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Edomte tunitan in Judahte tung ah a hel lailai uhi. Huai hun mah in Libnah leng a na helsam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehoram tanchin dangte leh a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a ki gelh keimaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoram a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi ah a vui ua; a sik in a tapa Ahaziah a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab tapa Joram lal kum sawmlehnih kum in Judah kumpipa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahaziah in vai a hawmpat in kum sawmnih leh nih a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum khat vai a hawm hi. A nu min Athaliah ahi a, amah Israel kumpipa Omri tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahab inkawte lampi tot a tawn sam a, Ahab inkawte hih bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih hi; Ahab inkawte makpapa a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah Ahab tapa Joram in Ramoth a Gilead khua a Suria kumpipa Hazael a va douna ah a pangsam hi. Suriate’n Joram a na hihliam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa Joram Suria kumpipa Hazael a douna ua Suriate’n Ramah khua ah a na hihliam uh, Jezreel khua a kidamsak din a kiknawnta hi. Judah kumpipa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah Ahab tapa Joram a damlouh ziak in veh din Jezreel khua ah a hohsuk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, zawlnei Elisha in zawlneite tapate lak a khat a sam a, a kiang ah, “Na puan teng inla, hiai sathau bawm tawi inla, Ramoth a Gilead khua ah va hoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na vatun chiang in Nimshi tapa Jehosaphat tapa Jehu va zongkhia inla; valut inla, a unaute lak apan sam khia inla, dantan sunggil ah lut pih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in sathau bawm la inla, a lu ah sung inla, Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Israelte tung a kumpipa din sathau k’on nilh hi, chi in. Huchi in kong hong inla, taikhia in, om sawt ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in tangval, zawlnei tangvalpa Ramoth a Gilead khua ah a hohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A vatun leh ngai in, sepaih heutute a tukhawm ua; aman, “Sepaih heutu, na kiang a gen ding thukhah ka nei,” a chi hi. Jehu in, “Kua pen kiang ah eita?” a chi hi. Aman, “Nang kiang ah, sepaih heutupa” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thou a, inn ah a lut a; a lu ah sathau asung a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Toupa mipite, Israelte tung a kumpipa din thau k’on nilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sikha zawlneite sisan leh Toupa’n sikha tengteng sisan phu Jezebel tung a ka lak theihna din na pu Ahab inkawte na that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab inkaw tengteng a mangthang vek ding uh. Ahab apan pasal taphot Israel gam a zalen hin sikha hita leh ka hihmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahab inkawte Nebat tapa Jeroboam inkawte leh Ahijah tapa Baasha inkawte bang in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uite’n Jezreel khaw kulh zul ah Jezebel a ne ding ua, amah vui ding mi a omkei ding” chi’n, a chi hi. Huchi in kong a hong a, a taikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Jehu bel a toupa sikhate kiang ah a hongpawt a; khat in a kiang ah, “Hoihlam thu hia? Huai mihaipa koi apan na kiang a hong ahia?” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Huai mi na thei ua; a thugen leng na thei uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau “Thei maizen dia, tun honhilh in” a chi uh. Aman, “Hichibang in a honchi ahi: ‘ Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Israelte tung a kumpipa din sathau k’on nilh hi’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in michih in a puan uh a suah somsom ua, kailawn tung ah a phahsak chiat ua, “Jehu kumpipa ahita ” chi’n pengkul a mutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Nimshi tapa Jehosaphat tapa Jehu in Joram thahna ding a guksawm hi. Suria kumpipa Hazael ziak in Joram leh Israelte tengteng in Ramoth a Gilead khua a veng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Joram Suria kumpipa Hazael toh a kidouna ua Suria mite’n a sukliam uh Jezreel khua a kidamsak din a kiknawn hi. Huchi in Jehu in, “Kei lam a pang na hih uleh kuamah Jezreel khua a hiai thu gen di’n khua apan paikhe sak kei un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Jehu bel kangtalai ah a tuang a, Jezreel khua ah a hoh a, Joram huai ah a lum hi. Judah kumpipa Ahaziah leng Joram veh din a hohsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel kulh ah galvilmi ading a, Jehu pawlte amah toh hongpai a mu a, “Mi tampi ka mu” a chi hi. Joram in, “Sakol tungtuang mi amau vadawn din sawl inla, Hoihlam thu hia?” va chi uhen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in mi khat sakol tung a tuang amau dawn din a kuan a, Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi: “Lemna thu toh hongpai na hi hia? a chi hi. Jehu in, Lemna thu toh hongpai leng, nang na theih ding bang a om a? Ka nung ah pai in” a chi hi. Galvilmi’n, “I misawl a kiang uh a vatung a, himahleh a hong kiknawn hetkei mawk” chi in a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in mi khat sakol tung a tuang a sawl nawn a, huai mi leng a kiang uh a va tung a, Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi: “Lemna thu toh hongpai na hi hia?” a chi hi. Jehu in a dawng a, “Lemna thu toh hongpai leng, nang na theih ding bang a om a? Ka nung ah pai in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Galvilmi leng a kiang uh a va tung a, amah leng a hong kiknawn hetkei mawk hi. “Huai kangtalai a kihawl dan leng Nimshi tapa Jehu hawl dan geih ahi; mihai bang mai in a hawl hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joram in, “Kimansak un” a chi a; kangtalai a kimansakta uh. Huchi in Israel kumpipa Joram leh Judah kumpipa Ahaziah amau kangtalai tuaktuak in a va pawtkhia ua, Jehu tuak din a taikhia ua, Jezreel mi Naboth huan ah a va mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joram in Jehu a muh in hichi ahi a, “Lemna toh hongpai na hia, Jehu?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Na nu Jezebel angkawmna leh bumna a tamlai teng bangchi’n lemna a omthei dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joram a kihei a, a tai a, Ahaziah kiang ah, “Kikhem a kilehbawlna om eive, Ahaziah” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehu in a thalpeu a theihtawp in a lai a, Joram liang leh liang kikal ah a kap a, thaltang in a lungtang a pailet a, a kangtalai sung ah a puklut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Jehu in a sepaih heutu Bidkar kiang ah, “Dom inla, Jezreel mi Naboth huan ah paikhia in. Tuma lam a nang toh a pa Ahab nung a i tuankhawm lai a Toupa’n hiai puakgik a tung ah a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n zan in Naboth sisan leh a tapate sisan ka muh ngei ahi” a chi hi. “ Toupa’n , hiai mun ngei ah k’on thuk ding” a chi nawn hi. Huchi in “ Toupa thu bang in dom inla, hiai mun ngei ah paikhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Judah kumpipa Ahaziah in huai a muh in huan in lampi ah a tai hi. Jehu in a delh a, “Amah leng huai kangtalai sung ah that un” a chi hi. Huchi in Ibleam kiang, Gur zottouhna ah a sat uhi. Meggiddo khua ah a tailut a, huai ah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A mite’n Jerusalem khua ah kangtalai in a paipih ua, amah han ah, a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahab tapa Joram kum sawmlehkhat a lal kum in Ahaziah Judahte tung ah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jehu Jezreel khua ah a valut chih Jezebel in a naza hi. Huchi in a mitte a nuh a, a sam a zem a, tohlet ah a na dak khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehu kulh kongpi a, a honglut laitak in, “Na pu thatpa nang Zimri, lemna thu toh hongpai na hi hia?” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tohlet lam nga in amah a daktou a, “Kei lam a pang kuakua na om ua? Kua?” a chi hi. Michilgeh nih hiam, thum hiam amah lam nga in a hong dak khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman “Hon lawnkhia un” a chi hi. Huchi in a lawnkhia ua; a si khenkhat in bang leh sakolte a theh nengnung a; aman lei ah a khe in a na chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in a lut a, ne in a dawn a; “Hamse thuaknu vadom unla, vavui un, kumpipa tanu lah ahi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vui din a kuan ua; himahleh a luguh, a khebomte leh a khutpek bomte kia loungal a mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in a hongpai nawn in a honghilh uh. Aman, “Hiai Toupa’n a sikha Tishbi mi Elijah zang a, Jezreel kulhchin ah uite’n Jezebel a ne ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jezebel luang Jezreel khaw kulhchin a huan a ekchim bang ahi dia, huchi a, hiai Jezebel eive, a chih louhna ding un, chi a a gen ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Ahab in Samaria ah tapa sawmsagih a nei hi. Jehu in Samaria a, Jezreel khaw heutute, upate leh Ahab tate a na dontei mite kiang ah, laigelh in a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hiai laikhakte na muhphet chiang un, na pu tate na kiang uah a om ua, kangtalaite, sakolte, kulhpi nei khuate leng, galvante toh na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in na pu tate lak a mi, a hoihpen leh a kizen pen zongkhia unla, a pa mangtutphah ah tusak unla, na pu uh inkawte adin galdou un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh amau a lau mahmah ua, “Ngai dih ua, kumpipa nihte’n a zohlouhsa uh ahi a, en bangchi’n i zou mahmah dia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa inn sung heutupen, khopi ukpen, upate, naupangte a na dawnteimi teng in Jehu kiang ah, “Na sikhate ka hi uh, hihdia n’on hilh tengteng ka hih ding uh. Kuamah kumpipa in ka bawl kei ding uh; nang hoih na saksak in hih in” chi in mi a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Kei lam a pang na hih ua, ka thu na man ding uleh na pute uh tapate lu honla unla, zingchiang in hichih hun ma in Jezreel khua ah ka kiang ah hong un,” chi in lai a khaknawn hi. Kumpipa tapate sawmsagih ahi ua, khopi miliante, amau dontei mite kiang ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Laikhak a muh un hichi ahi a, kumpipa tapate a man ua, a sawmsagih un a that ua, a lute uh bawmpi a koih in Jezreel khua ah a kiang ah a khakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thangkou khat a hongtung a, “Kumpipa tapate lu a hon tawita uh” chi’n a hilh uh. Aman “Kulh lutna kongpi gei ah mun nih in sekhawm unla, zingchiang tan in om hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zingchiang in hichi ahi a, a vapawt a, ading a, mi tengteng kiang ah, “Noute diktat hi un, ngai un, ka pu ka guksawm a, ka hihlumta a; ahihleh hiai tengteng kua thah ahia leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n Ahab inkawte tungtang a gen, Toupa thu lei ah a ke hetkei ding chih thei un; Toupa’n a sikha Elijah zang a a gen a hontung sakta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Jehu in Jezreel khua a Ahab inkuan a mi omsun teng, a milian tengteng, a lawm tengteng leh a siampute khat lel leng hawi sak hetlou in a that siang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in a thou a, a pawt a, Samaria ah a hohta hi. Lampi a belampute belam mulmetna in a va tun in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehu in Judah kumpipa Ahaziah unaute a mu a, “Kuate na hi ua?” a chi hi. Amau “Ahaziah unaute ka hi uh, Kumpipa tate leh kumpinu tate chibai vabuk dia paisuk ka hi uh” chi in a dawng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Hing mat un” a chi a; huchi in a hing mat ua, belam mulmetna in khukchin ah a that ua, mi sawmli leh nih ahi ua; khat lel leng a hawikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai apan a pawt nung in Rekab tapa Jehonadab, amah dawn dia hongpai a mu hi. Chibai a buk a, a kiang ah, “Na tung a lungsim dik ka put bang in, lungsim dik na pu sam hia?” a chi hi. Jehonadab in, “Pu e” chi in a dawng hi. “Ahihleh na khut honpe dih” a chi a; huchi in a khut a pia a, aman a kiang ah kangtalai sung ah a kailut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah “Hong sam inla, Toupa adia phatuam ka ngaihdan mu himhim dih” a chi hi. Huchi in a kangtalai ah a tuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samaria a vatun in Ahab inkawte Samaria a omsunte a hihman khitvek masiah a that zel a, Elijah kiang a a gen Toupa thu bang ngei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehu in mite tengteng a samkhawm a, a kiang uah, Ahab in Baal na a sem zekphet ahi a, Jehu in bel nakpi’n a sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Baal zawlnei tengteng, a bemi tengteng leh a siampu tengteng ka kiang ah hon samkhawm dih ua. Kuamah kimlou kei uhen; Baal kiang ah kithoihna thupitak lat ding ka nei a; kuapeuh a kimlou a hing hetkei ding, a chi hi. Himahleh Jehu in Baal bemite hihlup tum in, gitlouh piltak a, a hih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehu in, “Baal min in khawmpi thupi bawl un” a chi hi. Huchi in a genzakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehu in Israel gam tengteng ah a khakkhia a; huchi in Baal bemi tengteng a hongpai ua, a tellou himhim a omkei uhi. Baal in ah a lut ua; Baal in kongpi apan a phaitam pha in a dim dipdep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kivatna puan kemmi kiang ah, “Baal bemi tengteng kivatna puan honla in” a chi hi. Huchi in kivatna puante a honla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehu, Rekab tapa Jehonadab toh Baal in ah a lut ua; Baal bemite kiang ah, “Hiai ah Baal bemite loungal, Toupa mite a omkha ding uh, zong unla, en vialvial dih uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kithoihnate leh haltum thillatte lan dia a lut un, Jehu in inkuan ah mi sawmgiat a na dingsak khin hi. “Na khut ua k’on piak kuapeuh a suahtak leh, a suaktami hinna tang a amah hinna lak ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Haltum thillat a lat khittak in hichi ahi a, Jehu in galvil sepaih leh a heutute uh kiang ah, “Lut unla, vathat un; kuamah suakta sak kei un” a chi hi. Huchi in namsau in a sat ua; galvil sepaih leh a heutute uh a paikhia ua, Baal inn sung ah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Baal in a milimte a lakhia ua, a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Baal lim a laichim ua, Baal in a hihsia ua, tunitan in dailenbuk in a zanglai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchibang in Jehu in Israel gam apan Baal a hihsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhna, Israelte thil a hihkhial sak a, a hihte Jehu in a tawpsan kei hi. Huai bel Bethel khua leh Dan khua a dangkaeng bawngnou limte biak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa’n Jehu kiang ah, “Ka mittung tak a thil na hih ziak leh ka lungsim a deihthusam bangtak a Ahab inkawte tung a na hih ziak in, na tapate suan lina tan in Israel mangtutphah ah a tu ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Himahleh Jehu in Toupa , Israelte Pathian dan a lungtang tengteng in a zuikei a; Jeroboam in Israelte thil hihkhial sak a, a hih khelh a tawpsan tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huailai in Toupa’n Israel gam letdan a neusak panta hi. Huchi in Hazael in Israel gam tengteng ah amau a nuaisiahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan apan suahlam, Gilead gam tengteng, Gadte, Reubente, Manassehte, Arnon guam a Aroer apan Gilead leh Vasan gam tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehu tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng, a thilhih theihdan tengteng Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in Jehu a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, Samaria khua ah a vui ua; a sik in a tapa Jehoahaz a honglal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Samaria gam a Israelte tung a Jehu vaihawm sung kum sawmnih leh giat ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Ahaziah nu Athaliah in a tapa a si chih a theih in, a thou a, kumpipa tapa tengteng a that vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah tapa Joash bel kumpipa Jehoram tanu, Ahaziah sanggamnu Jehoseba in kumpipa tapa a thahte uh lak apan pimang in, a donmi toh lupna dantan ah a omsak a; Athaliah muhtheih louh din a sel ua, huchi in thah ahita kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah bel amah toh Toupa inn ah kum guk a kibu ua, huchi in, Athaliah in huai gam ah vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kum sagihna ah Jehoiada in Keroth mite leh galvil sepaihte lak a mi sepaih za heutute a samsaka, Toupa inn ah a kiang ah a pi lutsak hi. A kiang uah thu a khung a, Toupa inn ah a kichiamsak a, kumpipa tapa a musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman, “Na hih ding uh hichibang ahi. Na lak ua sabbath a hong dingte seh thum suah seh khat in kumpipa inn na veng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seh thum suah seh khat bel Sur kulh kongpi ah na om ding uh. Huchibang in na veng ding ua, a siat ding na dal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lak ua pawl nih, Sabbath a pai dingte’n kumpipa kiang ah Toupa inn na veng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Michih in galvantawi in kumpipa na umsuak ding ua; kuapeuh huai huamsung a honglut na thahzel ding uh ahi. Huchi in kumpipa a lut leh a pawt zui vialvial un” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaih za heutute’n siampu Jehoiada thupiak bangbang in a hih ua; amau heutu chiat khawlni a hong dingte leh sabbath a pai dingte a pi ua, siampu Jehoiada kiang ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siampu in sepaih za heutute Toupa inn a om, kumpipa David teipite leh lumte a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Galvil sepaihte’n galvan tawichiat in, Tempul sik taklam a kipan veilam tan in maitam leh inn zul ah kumpipa adin umkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa tapa a hon pikhia a, lallukhu a khusak hi. Theihsakna thu a pia a; kumpipa in a bawl ua, sathau a nilh ua; a khut uh a beng ua, “Pathian in kumpipa hondam hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galvilmi leh mipite husa Athaliah in a na zak in, Toupa inn ah mipite lak ah a vahoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A en a, ngai in, kumpipa dan dungzui in khuam zul ah a na ding a, sepaih heutute leh pengkul mutmite bel kumpipa kiang nai ah ading uhi. Huai gam mite’n nuam a sa mahmah ua, pengkul a mut uh. Huchi in Athaliah in a puante a botkek a, “Guk sawmna! Guk sawmna ahita ve!” chi’n a kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siampu Jehoiada in sepaihte tung a heutute dia a seh sepaih za heutute thu a pia a, a kiang uah, “Sepaihte kikal ah pawtsak in. Kuapeuh amah zui namsau a satlup ding ahi” a chi hi. Siampu in, “ Toupa inn a thah ding ahi kei” a na chita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in a man ua; kumpipa inn a sakolte lutna lampi a pai in, huai ah a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada in Toupa leh kumpipa leh mipite kikal leh kumpipa leh mipite kikal ah Toupa mite a hihna ding un thukhun a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai gammi tengteng Baal inn ah a hoh ua, a hihchim ua; a maitamte leh a limte a hihnen dimdem ua, Baal siampu Mattan leng maitam bul ah a that uh. Huchi in siampu in Toupa inn vengmi heutute a septa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman sepaih za heutute, vengmite, galvil sepaihte leh huai gam a mi tengteng a pi a, Toupa’n in apan kumpipa a pikhia ua, galvilmite kongpi tawn in kumpipa inn a lut in, kumpipa mangtutphah ah a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in huai gam a mi tengteng a kipak ua, khopi buai lou in a omta hi; Athaliah namsau in kumpipa inn ah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joash in vai a hawm patlai in kum sagih a upa ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehu kum sagih a lal kum in Joash a lal pan hi. Jerusalem ah kum sawmli a lal a; a nu min Zibiah ahi a, Beer–sheba khomi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siampu Jehoiada in Joash a sinsak sung teng Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh munsang teng hihsiat vek ahi tuankei a; munsangte ah mite kithoih lailai in gimlim a hal nilouh lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joash in siampute kiang ah, “ Toupa inn a laklut thilzek tatna sum teng simsate lak a pai peuhmahte a hinna uh tatna sumte, kuapeuh in Toupa inn a laklut a phal uh sum tengtengte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />siampute’n a meltheihte ua pan la uhenla; inn sia, a siatna na bawl uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh hichi ahi a, kumpipa Joash bel kum sawmnih leh thum a lal nung in leng siampute’n inn sia a bawlkei lailai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Joash in siampu Jehoiada leh siampu dangte a sam a, a kiang uah, “Bangdia inn siatna bawllou na hi ua? Tun zaw na sumkemte apan dangka la nawn kei unla, inn sia bawlna din pekhe zawta un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampute’n mite apan dangka lak nawnlouh leh inn siatna puahphat louh pha a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh siampu Jehoiada in bawm a la a, a sin gei a vutvang a, Toupa inn lutna taklam pang, maitam kiang ah a tung hi. Huai bawm ah Toupa inn a dangka tawilut tengteng kongkhak vengmi siampute’n a na koih zel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, bawm ah dangka a tamta chih a theih un, kumpipa Laigelhmi leh siampu lianpen Toupa inn ah a vahoh ua, sumte a sim ua ipte ah a thun khe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A dangka sim uh nasemmite, Toupa inn lammite tung a heutute khut ah a pekhia ua; amau Toupa inn lammite leh khutsiamtmite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />suangsekmite leh suanglaikhe mite kiang ah, Toupa inn siatna bawlna ding sing leh suangte leh inbawlna,a khawkna peuh a zat din a pekhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa insung a dangka a hontawi un, Toupa inn ading dangka siknoute, khawnvak puan tehnate, maiphiat kuangte, pengkulte, dangkaeng tuium belsuante, dangkasik tuium belsuante a bawl kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nasemmite a pe zel ua, Toupa inn bawlna in a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nasemmite piak dia dangka a kepsak mite uh leng a etzui pih tuankei uh. Amau ginom tak in a hihzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mawhna thoihna dia thillat dangka leh khelhna thoihna dia thillat dangkate bel Toupa inn ah a lalut kei ua; siampute tantuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Suria kumpipa Hazael in Gath khua a vasual a, a la a; Hazael in Jerusalem a hoh a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash in Judah kumpipa apu Jehosaphat, Jehoram leh Ahaziah in a na latsa thilzek tengteng leh amah thilzekte leh, Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a gou koihkhawmna a dangkaeng om tengteng a la vek a, Suria kumpipa Hazael a khak a; huchi in Jerusalem a pawtsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Joash tanchin dangte, a thilhihte tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sikhate a thou ua, a guk in a sim sawm ua, Joash bel Silla zot sukna lampi Millo inn ah a sual ua; a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah Simeath tapa Jozakar leh Somer tapa Jehozabad te’n a that ua; huchi in a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi ah a vui ua; a tapa Amaziah a sik in a hong lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Ahaziah tapa Joash kum sawmnih leh thum a lal kum in Jehu tapa Jehoahaz Israelte tung ah Samaria khua ah a lal pan a, kum sawmlehsagih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih a, Israelte thil hihkhial sak a, a hih Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhnate aman leng a hih samta a, a paisan nawn kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Israelte tung ah a heh mahmah a, huchi in Suria kumpipa Hazael khut leh, Hazael tapa Benhadad khut ah a damsung teng a pevekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoahaz in Toupa kiang ah nget chihtak in a ngen a, Toupa’n a thu a ngaihkhiak sak a; Israel simmawh a om a, Suria kumpipa’n amau a simmawh dan lah a mu kilkel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Israelte hondampa a pia a, huchi in Suriate nuai apan a pawtkhia uh. Israel suante tuma lam bang in amau in ah a om kinken uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Israelte thil a na hih khialsak a Jeroboam inkawte khelhnate a paisan kei ua, a hih lailai zawsop ua; Samaria khua ah Aserah leng a om lailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaz in a mite lak a sakol tungtuang mi sawmnga, kangtalai sawm leh sepaih sing khat chihlouh a neih a phalsak ngalkei a; Suria kumpipa’n a hihmang vek a, leivui chilzan bang in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoahaz tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengtengte, a thilhihtheih dante Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi in Jehoahaz bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; Samaria khua ah a vui ua; a tapa Jehoash a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash kum sawmthum leh sagih a lal kum in Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash Israelte tung ah Samaria khua ah a lal pan a, kum sawmlehguk a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou pipi a na hih a; Israelte thil hihkhialsak a a hih Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhna tengteng a paisan kei a, a ching lailai zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoash tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng, Judah kumpipa Amaziah toh a kisuallai ua a thilhih theihdante Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoash a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; Jeroboam a mangtutphah ah a tu a, Jehoas bel Samaria Khua ah Israel kumpipate lak ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha a chi a na a, a chinatna a sihpih hi. Huchi in Israel kumpipa Jehoash a kiang ah a hohsuk a, a kah a, “Aw, ka pa, ka pa, Israelte kangtalai leh sakol tungtuangmite” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elishain a kiang ah, “Thalpeu leh thaltangte honla in” a chi a; aman thalpeu leh thaltangte a honla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israelte kumpipa kiang ah, “Thalpeuh tung ah na khut nga in” a chi hi. Huchi in a khut a nga a; Elisha in kumpipa khut tung ah a khut a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman, “Suahlam tohlet hong in” a chi hi. Huchi in a honghi. Elisha in, “Kap in” a chi a; a kap hi. Aman “ Toupa hotkhiatna thaltang leh Suria apan hotkhiatna thaltang; Aphek khua ah na zoh tanpha in Suriate na sual ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thaltangte honla in” a chi a, Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “Lei sun dih” a chi a; huchi in thumvei a sun a, a tawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian mi a tung ah a heh a, “Ngavei ahihkeileh gukvei na sut ding eive; huchi in Suriate mangthang vek khop in na zou ding. Himahleh Suriate thumvei kia zou ding na hita ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Elisha a si a, a vui uh. Kum a hong kivei in, Moab pawlte’n a gam uh a hong dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat a vui laitak un hichi ahi a, ngai in, mi pawl khat a mu uh. Huchi in huai mi Elisha han sung ah a khemawk ua; a luang in Elisha guhte a sukkhak tak in, a hong hing nawn a, ading touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Suria kumpipa Hazael in Jehoahaz damsung teng in Israelte a nuaisiah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a thu a khun ziak in amau a hehpih a, a lainat a, a zahtak a, amau a hihmang nuam kei a, a kiang apan a paikhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria kumpipa Hazael a si a; a tapa Benhadad a sik in a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash in Hazael tapa Benhadad in a pa Jehoahaz a dou a, khua a laksakte a sutnawn a, Joash in thumvei a zou a, Israel gam khuate a la kiknawn hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash kum nih a lal kum in Judah kumpipa Joash tapa Amaziah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnih leh kua a lal a; a nu min Jehoadan, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil dik a hih a, himahleh a pu David zaw a phakei; a pa Joash thilhih bang a hih sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munsangte lakmang ahi tuankei a, munsangte ah mite a kithoih lai ua gimlim a hallai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalgam a khut a hong kip tak in hichi ahi a, a pa, kumpipa thatmi amah sikhate a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh huai tualthatmite tate a that kei hi. Mosi Dan bu a “Tate ziak in pate hihlup ding ahi kei a, pate ziak in leng tate hihlup ding ahi sam kei, michih amau khelhna ziak in a si ding uh” chi a Toupa thupiak gelh a hih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edomte chi guam ah sing khat a that a, Selah khua a sual a, a la a, a min din Joktheel a sa a, tunitan in hiai ahilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Amaziah in Israel kumpipa Jehu tapa Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash kiang ah, hong kuan in, kimai tuah ni, chi in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Judah kumpipa Amaziah kiang ah, “Lebanon tang a ling in Lebanon tang a sidar sing kiang ah, Na tanu ka tapa zi din neisak dihve, chi in a thukhak a; Lebanon tang a gamsa a hongpai a, huai ling a hong tuanpuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang Edomte na zou ngei a, na lungtang a hong kisathei hi; na kisaktheihna ompih maimai in; nang leh Judah nangawn tan a siatna, nang adia hoihlou ding thil bang ding a khoihkhe ding na hia?” chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Amaziah in a na ngaikhe nuam kei a; huchi in Israel kumpipa Jehoas a va hohtou a vadouta hi. Judah kumpipa Amaziah toh Judah gam Beth-shemesh ah a va kimaituahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah bel Israelte ma ah a zahlakta a; michih amau in chiat ah a taikekta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Judah kumpipa Ahaziah tapa Joash tapa Amaziah Beth-shemesh ah a man a, Jerusalem khua ah a paipih a, Jerusalem kulh, Ephraim kongpi apan kulh ning kongpi pha in tong za li a hihchim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa inn leh kumpipa in a gou koihkhawmna a dangkaeng leh dangka leh tuium-belsuan om tengteng a la a, thuchiam tangtunna dia mat a om mite toh, huchi in, Samaria kholam ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoash thilhih tanchin dangte, a thilhihtheih dante, Judah kumpipa Amaziah a dou thute Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoash a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, Samaria khua ah Israel kumpipate lak ah a vui ua; a tapa Jeroboam a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash tapa Amaziah Israel kumpipa Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash sih nung in kum sawmlehnga a damlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Amaziah tanchin dangte Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah amah a guksawm ua; huchi in Lakish khua ah mi a delhsak ua, huai ah a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A luang sakol in a paipih ua, a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi Jerusalem ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah mi tengteng in kum sawm leh kum guk a upa, Azariah a pi ua, a pa Amaziah sik in kumpipa in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman Elath khua a bawl hoihnawn in Judah gam ah a pangsak nawn a; huai nung in kumpipa a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash tapa Amaziah kum sawmlehnga a lal kum in Israel kumpipa Jehoash tapa Jeroboam Samaria khua ah a lal pan a, kum sawmli leh khat a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Israelte thil a hihkhial sak a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhna tengteng a paisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Pathian in a sikha, Gath hepher mi Amittai tapa zawlnei Jonah zang a a thugen bang in, Hamath lutna apan a Arabah Tuipi pha in Israel gam ah a pangsak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n Israelte haksatna a thupi mahmah chih lah a thei ngal a; sal hin noplen hitaleh a thuakdan uh a kibang a; Israelte panpih ding kuamah omsam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel min van nuai ah a chimitsak zenzen ding chih ahihleh a genkei him a; Jehoash tapa Jeroboam zang in a hondam zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Jeroboam tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengtengte, a thilhihtheih dante, a galdou thute, tuma lam in Judah gam tan hi gige Damaska leh Hamath khua Israelte adia a na laksak nawn thute Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeroboam a pi leh pu, Israel kumpipate kiang ah a ihmu samta a; huchi in a tapa Zakariah a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam kum sawmnih leh sagih a lal kum in Judah kumpipa Amaziah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal pattung in kum sawmlehguk a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh nih a lal a; a nu min Jekoliah, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Amaziah thilhih bangbang hihsam in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh munsangte lakmang ahi tuankei. Munsangte ah mite kithoih lailai in, gimlim a hal lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n kumpipa a gawt a, huchi in a sih ni pha in a phak a, inn tuam ah a tengta hi. Kumpipa tapa Jotham in a gam ua mite vai hawmsak in inkuan tung a heutu in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Azariah tanchin dangte a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azariah bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi ah a vui ua; huchi in a tapa Jotham a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Azariah kum sawmthum leh giat a lal kum in Jeroboam tapa Zakariah Israelte tung ah Samaria ah kha guk a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pute hih mah bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Israelte thil a hihkhial sak Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhnate a paisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesh tapa Shallum in a guksawm a, mipite ma ah a sual a, a that a, a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Zakariah tanchin dangte bel ngai dih, Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai bel Toupa’n Jehu kiang a, “Na tapate suan lina tan in Israelte mangtutphah ah a tu ding uh” chih thu a gen ahi. Huchi in huai bang geih a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Uzziah kum sawmthum leh kua a lal kum in Jabesh tapa Shallum a lal pan a; Samaria khua ah kha khat sung a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gadi tapa Menahem Tirzah khua apan a hohtou a, Samaria ah a hoh a, Jabesh tapa Shallum Samaria khua ah a sual a, a that a, a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Shallum tanchin dangte, a sawmgukna thute ngai dih, Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Menahem in Tirzah apan Tiphsah leh asung a om tengteng leh a gamte a sual a; amah adia a ki honlouh ziak un a sual a; huai ah naupai lai numei tengteng a pik kek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Azariah kum sawmthum leh kua a lal kum in Gadi tapa Menahem Israelte tung ah a lal pan a, Samaria ah kum sawm a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Israelte thil hihkhialsak Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhna a damsung in a paisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa Pul in a gam a hongsual a; gam a neihkip pih theihna din Menahem in Pul dangka talent sang khat a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Menahem in Assuria kumpipa piak din Israel mi neizou tengteng lak ah dangka sekel sawmnga chiat a khon a; huchi in Assuria kumpipa a pai nawn a, huai gam ah a tam nilouh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Menahem tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Menahem a pi leh pute kiang ah ihmuta a; a tapa Pekahiah a sik in a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Azariah kum sawmnga a lal kum in Menahem tapa Pekahiah Israelte tung ah Samaria khua ah a lal pan a, kum nih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Israelte thil hihkhial sak, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhnate a paisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sepaih heutu Remaliah tapa Pekah in amah a guksawm a, Samaria khua a kumpipa in a kulh ah Argob toh, Arieh toh a thatta a; a kiang ah Gilead mi sawmnga toh; huchi in Pekahiah a that a, a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in Pekahiah tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengtengte ngai dih, Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Azariah kum sawmnga leh nih a lal kum in Remaliah tapa Pekah Israelte tung ah Samaria khua ah a lal pan a, kum sawmnih a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Israelte thil hihkhial sak, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelhnate a paisan kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Pekah lal lai in Assuria kumpipa Tiglath-pileser in Ijon, Abel beth maakah, Janoah, Kadesh, Hazor, Gilead leh Galili gamte leh Naphtali gam tengteng a la a Assuria gam ah sal in a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Elah tapa Hosea in Remaliah tapa Pekah a guksawm a, a sual a, a that a, Uzziah tapa Jotham kum sawmnih a lal kum in a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Pekah tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng, ngai dih, Israel kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Remaliah tapa Pekah kum nih a lal kum in Judah kumpipa Uzziah tapa Jotham a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehguk a lal a; a nu min Jerus, Zadok tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pa Uzziah thilhih bangbang hih sam in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Himahleh munsangte hihmang ahi tuankei; munsangte ah mite’n kithoih in, gimlim a hallai uhi. Toupa inn kongpi saknung zaw a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in Jotham tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huailai in Suria kumpipa Rezin leh Remulia tapa Pekah Judate sual din Toupa’n a sawlpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jotham a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a pi pute lak ah a pu David khopi ah a vui ua; a tapa Ahaz a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah tapa Pekah kum sawmlehsagih a lal kum in Judah Kumpipa Jotham tapa Ahaz a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaz a lal pattung in kum sawmnih a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehguk a lal hi. A pu David bang in Toupa a Pathian mitmuh in thil hoih a hih sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpipate tot lampi a tawnsam a, ahi, Toupa’n Israel suante ma a a delhkhiaksa namte thil kihhuaitak a hih bang un a tapa mei ah a lutsuak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munsangte leh tangte tung ah leh sing hing chih nuai ah kithoih in gimlim a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Suria kumpipa Rezin leh Israel kumpipa Remaliah tapa Pekah Jerusalem dou din a kuantou ua; Ahaz ava um ua, himahleh a zou theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huailai in Suria kumpipa Rezin in Elath khua Suria gam din a lanawn a, Judahte Elath khua apan a delhkhia a; huchi in Suriate’n Elath khua a va luah ua, tunitan in a tenglai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Ahaz in Assuria kumpipa Tiglath-pileser kiang ah, Na sikha leh na tapa ka hi ka hia; kei hong dou dia hong kuan, Suria kumpipa khut apan leh Israel kumpipa khut apan hon hunkhe dihve, chi in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaziah in Toupa inn a dangka leh dangkaeng om peuhmah leh kumpipa in a gou koihkhawmte a la a, Assuria kumpipa kiang ah thilpiak din a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n a thugen a na pom a; huchi in Assuria kumpipa’n Damaska khua a vadou a, a la a, a mite Kir gam ah sal in a pi a, Rezin a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz bel Assuria kumpipa Tiglath-pileser houpih din Damaska khua ah a hoh a, Damaska khua a maitam a va mu a huchi in kumpipa Ahaz in huai maitam lim leh a kibawl dan banggeih etton din siampu Urijah kiang ah a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siampu Urijah in maitam a bawl a; kumpipa Ahaziah in Damaska khua apan a khak banggeih in siampu Urijah in Damaska khua apan a Ahaz a hongpai nawn in a na bawl khinvekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaska khua apan kumpipa a hongtun in maitam a mu a; kumpipa’n maitam a naih a, a tung ah thillatte a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maitam ah a haltum thillat hal in tangbuang thillat a lan a, dawn thillat asung a, a lemna thillatte sisan a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa ma a dal maitam a la a, maitam leh Toupa inn kikal a, inn mazawn apan a lasuan a, a maitam mallam pang ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz in, maitam lianpi tung ah zinglam haltum thillat, nitaklam tangbuang thillat, haltum thillat, tangbuang thillat, i gam ua mipi tengteng haltum thillat, tangbuang thillat leh dawn thillat toh hal in lan inla; a tung ah haltum thillat sisan tengteng leh kithoihna sisan tengteng theh in; dal maitam bel kei thudotna ding ahi, chi in siampu Urijah thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in siampu Urijah in kumpipa Ahaz thupiak bangbang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz in tunna kuakte a atkhia a, kisilna bel a koih khia a; a tunna dal bawngtal apan lakhia in suanglep tung ah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sabbath adia a tungnei lampi in a bawl uleh in pawlam a kumpipa lutna Toupa inn apan Suria kumpipa adin a kheng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Ahaz thilhih tanchin dangte Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Ahaz a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, a pi leh pute lak ah David khopi ah a vui ua; a tapa Hezekiah a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Ahaz kum sawmlehnih a lal kum in Elah tapa Hosea Israelte tung ah Samaria ah a lal pan a, kum kua sung a lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou tak a hih a, himahleh a ma a Israel kumpipate bangzen in zaw ahihkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa Salmaneser in a vadou a, huchi in Hosea a sikha a honghi a, siah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Hosea Aigupta kumpipa So kiang a mi sawl in a guksawm chih a na theikhia a; a kum chin a, a piak zel bang in leng Assuria kumpipa kiang ah siah a pekei behlap lai a; huaiziak in Assuria kumpipa’n suangkulh ah hensa in a khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Assuria kumpipa’n gam tengteng a tuan suakvek a, Samaria ah a hohtou a, kum thum a umkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hosea kum kua a lal kum in Assuria kumpipa’n Samaria a la a, Israelte Assuria gam ah a pi a, Halah, Habor a Gozan lui leh Mediate khuate ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchibang a, a na omna uh bel Israel suante’n Aigupta kumpipa Pharo khut nuai apan, Aigupta gam apan a pikhepa Toupa a Pathian uh tung a thil a hihkhelh ua, pathian dangte a lau ziak uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel suante ma a, a na delhkhiaksa namte thuzoh leh Israel kumpipate thusehte a zuihzawk ziak uh leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel suante’n Toupa a Pathian uh tung ah thil hoihlou tak a guk in a hih uh. A khaw teng uah galvilmite insang apan kulhnei khote pha in munsangte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tang sangteng ah pathian limte leh sing hing teng nuai ah suangphuhte phut in Aserah songte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai munsang tengteng ah Toupa’n a ma ua a delhmangsa namte hihbang in gimlim a hal ua; Toupa hehsak din thil gilou a hihlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang uah, “Hichibang hihkei un” a chih milim pathiante na leng a sem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n , Dan zuih ding na pi leh pute uh ka piak leh ka sikha zawlneite zang a k’on theihsak bangzel in, “Na omdan gilou uh lehngatsan unla, ka thupiakte leh ka thusehte zui un” chi’n Israelte leh Judah zawlnei chih leh muthei michih zang in a theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi pipi in leng a zui nuam kei ua, a pi leh pute un Toupa a Pathian uh gingta nuamlou a, a ngawng uh a khauhsak mah bang un, a ngawng uh a khauhsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thusehte, a pi leh pute uh toh a thukhun, a kiang ua a thu theihsakte a nial ua; thil ginalou a zui ua, bangmah louphet a hong hita uh. A tungthu ua Toupa’n , amau bang in zaw hihkei un, a na chihsa, a kiang ua namte a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa a Pathian uh thupiak tengteng a lehngatsan ua, bawngnou limsun nih a bawl ua, Aserah song a bawl ua, van a om tengteng a bia ua, Baal na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tapate uh leh a tanute uh mei tawn in a lutsak ua, aisan leh bum a ching ua, Toupa hehna tokthou din a mitmuh in thil hoihlou hih din a kizuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa Israelte tung ah heh petmah in a heh a, a muh phaklouhna ding ah a suanmang a; Judah nam kia loungal a omta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judahte’n leng Toupa a Pathian uh thupiakte a zuikei ua, Israelte bawltawm thusehte a zui zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel suante himhim a deihta kei a, amau a hihgenthei a, a muh phaklouh ua a suanmang masiah lokmite khut ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israelte lah David inkawte a hihna uh a paihsakta ngal a; huchi in Nebat tapa Jeroboam pen kumpipa din a bawl ua; Jeroboam in Israelte’n Toupa a zuih uh a hawlkawi a, thil gilou thupi mahmah a hihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel suante’n Jeroboam thil hihkhelh bangbang a hihsam ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n a zawlnei tengteng zang a a na gensa bang a a muh phaklouhna a, a suanmang masiah huaite a paisan ngalkei ua. Huchi in Israelte amau gam apan Assuria gam ah a pi ua, tunitan in huai gam ah omlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Babulon khomite, Kuth khomite, Ava khomite, Hamath khomite leh Sepharvaim khomite a thukhak khia a, Samaria khote ah Israel suante mun a luahsak a; huchi in Samaria gam a luah ua, a khuate ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huailai a a om tung un hichi ahi a, Toupa laudan a siamkei ua, huchi in Toupa’n a lak uah humpinelkaite a sawl a, khenkhatte a keilum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in Assuria kumpipa kiang ah, “Na lakkhiaka, Samaria gam khuate a na koih namte’n hiai gam Pathian omdan a theikei ua, huaiziak in, a lak uah humpinelkaite a sawl a; ngai dih, hiai gam Pathian omdan a theihlouh ziak un a that uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in Assuria kumpipa’n, “Huai a sal a na pite uh lak a siampu khat pi unla, hong omsam henla, huai gam Pathian biak dan sinsak hen” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Samaria gam apan a pite uh lak a siampu khat Bethel khua ah a va teng a, Toupa lauh ding dan a sinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh namchih in amau pathian chiat a kibawl ua, Samari mite’n munsang a na bawl innte ah namchih in amau omna khua chiat ah huai a pathiante chiat uh a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon mite’n Sukkoth benoth a bawl ua, Kuthte’n Nergal a bawl ua, Hamathte’n Ashima a bawl ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Avate’n Nibhaz leh Tartak a bawl uhi. Sepharvaimte’n pathiante Adrammelek leh Anammelek kiang ah a tate a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa laudan a siam ua, a lak ua mi neupente mun sang siampute in a bawl ua, munsang innte ah amau adin thil a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa a lau ua, a pikhiakna gam ua namte hihdan bang in amau pathiante na a sem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuma lam a, a hihdan bang un tunitan in a hihlai lai uhi. Toupa laudan a siamkei ua, Toupa’n Jakob suan Israel a chihte kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“pathian dangte zaw lau kei unla, amau bekei unla, a kiang ah kithoih kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Toupa , thilhihtheihna thupitak leh banzak hial a Aigupta gam apan nou hon pikhepa amah laudan na siam zawk ding uh ahi, amah na biak ding uh ahi a, amah kiang a na kithoih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in thusehte, vaihawmte, dante, thupiakte a hon na gelhsak sate tangtawn in na pom gige ding uh ahi; pathian dangte laudan na siam ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na kiang ua thu ka khun pen na mangngilh ding uh ahi kei; pathian dangte leng laudan na siam ding uh ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh laudan na siam ding uh ahi. Huchi in na melma tengteng khut apan aman a hon hunkhe dia, chi a thu a khun a, amau adia Toupa thupiakte, thusehte, vaihawmte, danbawlte, a zui tuankei uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bangchi mah bang in leng a zui nuamtuan kei ua, tuma lam a a hihdan bang un a hihlai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huchi in huai namte’n Toupa a lau ua; a milim bawltawmte uh na leng a semlai uh. Huchi mah bang in a suante uh leh a suante uh suante tan in leng tunitan in a pi leh pute uh hihbang in a hihlai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Elah tapa Israel kumpipa Hosea kum thum a lal kum in hichi ahi a, Judah kumpipa Ahaz tapa Hezekiah a lal pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmnih leh kua a lal a; a nu min Abi, Zakariah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pu David thilhih tengteng hihsam in, Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munsangte a hihgawp a, suangphuhte a hihchim a, Aserahte a phuk a; Mosi dalgul bawl a kitam nensak vek a; huai hun tanpha in Israel suante’n a kiang ah gimlim a hal ngal ua, aman huai Nehustan a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Toupa , Israelte Pathian a muang a; huchi in a nung a Judah kumpipa tengteng lak ah amah bang kuamah a omkei ua, a malam in leng a omsam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa a len chinten a, amah zuih a tawp nuam kei a, a thupiak, Toupa’n Mosi a piakte a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa a kiang ah a om a; a vak khiakna peuh ah a lamzang a; Assuria kumpipa tung ah a hel a, a na a semta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philistiate Gaza khua tan in a gamgi chiang tengteng toh, galvilmi insang apan kulhnei khopi tan in a that vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah kum li a lal kum, Israel kumpipa Elah tapa Hosea kum sagih a lal kum in hichi ahi a, Assuria kumpipa Salmaneser in Samaria a hong dou a, a um kimvel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum thum a chin kum in a lazou a; Hezekiah kum guk a lal kum, Israel kumpipa Hosea kum kua a lal kum in ahi Samaria khua a lakzoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Assuria gam ah Israel a pimang a, Halah, Habor, Gozan lui leh Mediate khuate a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa a Pathian uh thu manglou a, a thukhun a bohse zaw a, Toupa’n a sikha Mosi thu a piak tengteng a zuihlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah kum sawmlehli a lal kum in Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib Judah gam a khaw kulh nei tengteng dou din a hohtou a, a lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Hezekiah in Lakish khua a Assuria kumpipa kiang ah, “Thil ka na hihkhial hi, kei apan kiknawn in, ka tung a n’on got peuhmah ka paw ding” chi a gen din mi a sawl hi. Assuria kumpipa’n Judah kumpipa Hezekiah dangka talent za thum leh dangkaeng talent sawmthum a bikhiah sak hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in Toupa inn a dangka om teng leh kongkhak a dangkaeng tengteng leh kumpipa gou koihkhawmna a om tengteng a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai tungmah in Hezekiah in Toupa biakin kongkhak a leh, Judah kumpipa Hezekiah inn khuampite dangkaeng a luante a lakhe vek a, Assuria kumpipa a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa’n Tartan, Rabsari leh Rabsakeh sepaih tampi toh Lakish khua apan Jerusalem khua a kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah a sawl hi. Jerusalem khua a tungtou ua; a tun touh un puansawpmi lamlian lampi a dil saknung zaw tuilakna kiang ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa a sap uleh, inn sung heutu Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, Laigelhmi Sebnah leh tanchin gelhmi Asaph tapa Joah a kiang uah a hong pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rabsakeh in a kiang uah, “Hezekiah kiang ah vagen dih ua, Kumpipa thupitak Assuria kumpipa in hichi in a chi: Na gin a na muan bang ahia oi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kidouna adin geldan siam leh hatna ka nei uh, na chi a; himahleh huaizaw paukam lel ahi. Kua ahia na muan a ka tung a na hel maizen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin, ngai in, hiai sialluang chiang, Aigupta muang na hita a; huai a mi a kingaih leh a khut a sun ding hi. Aigupta kumpipa Pharo bel amah muang tengteng tung ah huchibang ahi naknak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, Ka kiang ah, Toupa ka Pathian uh ahi ka muan uh, na chih uleh, amah pen Hezekiah in Judah leh Jerusalem kiang a Jerusalem a hiai maitam ma ah na biak ding uh ahi, chi a munsangte leh a maitamte a lakmang sakpa ahi ka hia? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in ka pu Assuria kumpipa toh thu kichiam dih ua, huchi in a tung a tuangmi ding na muhtheih peuhmah ding leh sakol sang nih k’on pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangchi’n ahia kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuang mite thu in Aigupta tung a na muanna koih in, ka pu mite lak a neupen heutu khat lel leng na nankik zoh mahmah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiai gam Toupa lou a hihse ding a hong kuantou ka hi ahia? Toupa’n ka kiang ah, hiai gam dou inla, hihsia in, chi ahi” chi in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hilkiah tapa Eliakim leh Sebnah leh Joahte’n Rabsakeh kiang ah, “Hehpih in na sikhate Suria pau in hon houpih in; huai lah ka theisiam ngal ua; kulh tung a mite ziak in Judah pau in hon houpih nawn ken” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Rabsakeh in a kiang uah, “Ka pu in na pu uh kiang leh nou kiang kia ah hiai thu gen din a honsawl ahia? Kulh tung a tute, noute leh a ek uh ne dingte kiang ah leng a honsawl ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rabsakeh ading a, Judah pau in aw ngaihtak in a kikou a, “Kumpipa thupitak Assuria kumpipa thu ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi, Hezekiah zekhem in omkei un; aman lah a khut apan nou hon humbit theilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekiah in, Toupa’n a hon humbit dia; hiai khopi Assuria kumpipa khut a piak ahi kei ding, chi in Toupa ah hon muangsak kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah thu pom kei un. Assuria kumpipa’n hichi in a chi. Hon kileppih unla, ka kiang ah hong pawtkhia un; michih in amah grepgui leh amah theipi kung a nechiat uhenla, michih in amah tuikhuk tui dawn chiat hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Noumau gambang a buh leh uain gam, tanghou leh grephuan gam, olive leh khuaizu gam, silou a na hin theihna ding uh gam a k’on pi masiah, Hezekiah in, Toupa’n hon humbit ding, chi a nou a hon zekhem in leng pom kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nam chihte pathian mawngmawng lak a himhim in a gam uh Assuria kumpipa apan a humbit ngeita uh hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad pathiante koi a omta uh ahia? Sepharvaim, Hena leh Ivah pathiante leng koi a omta ahi ua? Samaria ka khut apan a humbit uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gamchih pathian tengteng lak a kuate ahi ua a gam uh ka khut apan humbit a, Toupa’n Jerusalem khua kei apan a humbit mahmah ding?” chi’n, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amau a dai sipsip ua, kam khat in leng a dawng kei uh: kumpipa thupiak dan, “Amah dawng ken” chih ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa inn sung heutu Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, Laigelhmi Sebnah leh tanchin gelhmi Asaph tapa Joahte’n a puansilh bohkekte uh silh in Hezekiah kiang ah a hoh ua, Rabsakeh thu gente a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa Hezekiah in huai a zak in hichi ahi a, a puansilhte a botkek a, saiip puan a silh a, Toupa inn ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inn sung heutu Eliakim, Laigelhmi Sebnah leh siampu upate saiip puansilh in Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai kiang ah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, Hezekiah in hichi in a chi. “Tuni mangbatna leh salhna leh minsiatna ni ahi. Naute lah a pian uh a hunta ngal a, piang sak ding in lah thahatna a om nawnta ngalkei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pu Assuria kumpipa’n Pathian hing gense dia a sawl Rabsakeh thugen tengteng, Toupa na Pathian in a za dia, a thugen, Toupa na Pathian in a thu a zak in a na salkha mai ding, huaiziak in, a omlai mite thumsak in” a chi va chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Hezekiah sikhate Isai kiang ah a hoh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isai in a kiang uah, Na pu kiang ah huchi in gen in, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Na zak, Assuria kumpipa mite’n a hon gensiatnate uh lau ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, asung ah kha ka omsak dia, thuthang a za dia, amah gam ah a pai nawn ding. Huchi in amah gam mahmah ah namsau puksak in ka omsak ding, a chi hi,” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Rabsakeh a kiknawn a, Assuria kumpipa’n Libna khua a na suallai a mu a; Lakish apan a pawt chih a zaksa him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngai in, Nang hondou din a pawtta” chi a Tirhak Ethiopia gam kumpipa tungtang mi gen a na zak in Hezekiah kiang ah mite a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi in Judah kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah na gen ding uh, “Na Pathian na muan in Jerusalem khua Assuria kumpipa khut ah piak ahi kei ding, chi in hon zekhem kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, Assuria Kumpipate’n gam tengteng hihse vek ua, a tung a a thilhih uh naza a; nang humbit na hi tuan dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namchih pathiante’n ka pi leh pute’n a hihmangte uh a humbit ua hia? Gozan, Haran, Reseph, Eden ta Thelasar khua a omte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath kumpipa, Arpad kumpipa, Sepharvaim khopi kumpipa, Hena kumpipa, Ivah kumpipa te koi a om ahita ua? chi’n” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in a misawlte khut apan lai a mu a, a sim a: Hezekiah Toupa inn ah a lut a, Toupa ma ah huai a phalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah Toupa ma ah a thum a, “ Toupa aw, Cherubte tung a tu, Israel Pathian, nang, nang kia leitung gam tengteng Pathian na hi a; lei leh van nangmah siamsa ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa aw, na bil na doh inla, ngai dih ve; Toupa aw, na mit hak inla, en dih ve; Pathian hing gense dia Sennakerib in thu a hong gen ngaikhe dihve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa , Assuria Kumpipate’n namte leh a gamte uh a hihse ngei ua, a pathiante uh mei ah a pai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiaite pathian ahi kei him ua, mihing khut a bawl sing leh suang ahizaw uhi. Huaiziak in, mei a pailut in a hihmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin Toupa , ka Pathian uh aw, nang, nang kia Toupa Pathian na hi chih leitung a lalgam tengteng in a theihtheihna ding un a khut apan hon humbit in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huailai in Amoz tapa Isai in Hezekiah kiang ah, Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi. Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib siatna dia ka kiang a na thum ka za, chih gen din mi a sawl hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah tungtang Toupa’n a gen hiai ahi: Zion tanu nungak siangthou in nang a hon musit a, a hon nuihsan a; Jerusalem tanu in a lu a hon sinkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kua na minse sak a, kua na gensia a? Kua tung ah ahia na aw na san sak a, na mit na hah sang? Israelte Mi Siangthoupa tung ah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na misawlte zang in Toupa na minse sak a, Ka kangtalai tampi toh Lebanon gamgi tangsangte k’ong tungtouta hi. Huai a Sidar sing sang pipite leh taksing hoih pipite ka phuk dia; a lei hoihna mun gammang a tenna mun ngil pen ah ka lut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamdang tui ka laikhia a, ka dawn zel a, ka khepek nuai ah Aigupta lui tengteng ka kangsak vek ding, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keimah in nidanglai apan huai ka hih ahihdan bang, malai apan huai ka bawl ahihdan bang naza ka hia? Khaw kulhneite in chinkhawm lel bang a hihsepa din nang k’on septa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in, asung a omte’n hatna a neikei ua, a lauthawng ua, a hong zahlakta uhi. Gamlak loupa bang leh loupa hing bang leh, intung a loupa bang leh, buh a let ma a hai vuai bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ken bel na tut, na lut, na pawt leh ka tung a na hehte ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tung a na heh ziak leh, uangtak a na pau ka bil a a hong luttouh ziak in ka nakbulh na nak ah ka bulh dia, ka sikbah na muk ah; na hong kuanna lampi mahmah ah k’on kiksak nawn ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai nang adia chiamtehna ahi ding. Tukum in buhsang na sen ding ua; kum nawn chiang in a sang mah; kum thumna ah buh na tuh ding ua, at unla, grephuante bawl unla, a gahte ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in Judah inkawte lak a damlai omsunte’n a suklam in zung a kai ding ua, a toulam in a gah nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem apan a omsunte Zion tang apan a damlaite a pawt khe ding uhi. Toupa phatuamngaihna in huaite a hih ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa’n Assuria kumpipa tungtang thu huchi in a gen, Hiai khopi ah a hong tungkei ding, hiai ah leng thal a kap sam kei ding, lum toh a kiang ah lah a hongpai kei dia, a khozul ah lah lei a se sang kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hong kuanna lampi ah, huai mah ah a nung kiknawn dia, hiai khopi a hongtung kei ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei ziak leh ka sikha David ziak in hiai khopi humbit ding in ka veng ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in huai zan in hichi ahi a, Toupa angel a kuan khia a, Assuriate giahphual ah mi nuai khat leh sing giat leh sang nga a that a; zingkhang a a hongthoh uleh, ngai in, misi luang ngen a na om maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib a pawt a, a kiknawn a, a pai zel a, Ninevi khua ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pathian Nisrok inn a amah a biaklai in hichi ahi a, Adrammelek leh Sarezerte’n namsau in a that ua; huchi in Ararat gam ah a tai lutta uh. Huchi in a tapa Esar haddon a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in Hezekiah muanmoh in a china hi. Huchi in Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai a kiang ah a hong a, a kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Na inkawte omdan ding gen in; damkhe zoulou ding na hi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in bang lam nga in a kihei a, Toupa kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Toupa aw, na ma a thutak leh lungtang hoihkim pu a ka omdan leh na mitmuh a thil hoih ka hihdan hehpih in theigige in” chi’n a thum hi. Huchi in Hezekiah kah petmah in a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isai huangsung intual laitak a tunma in hichi ahi a, Toupa thu a kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kiknawn inla, ka mite heutu Hezekiah kiang ah gen in, Toupa’n , na pu David Pathian in hichi in a chi, ‘Na thumna ka za a, na khitui kia leng ka mu hi. Ngai in, k’on damsak ding; ni thum ni’n Toupa inn ah na hohtou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na damsung kumte kum sawmlehnga in ka behlap dia; nang leh hiai khopi Assuria kumpipa apan ka humbit ding’. Keimah ziak leh ka sikha David ziak in hiai khopi ka hum ding” a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isai in, Theipi gah beukhat honla un, a chi a; huchi in a honla ua, a meimatum ah a tat a, a hong dam nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah in Isai kiang ah, “ Toupa’n a hon damsak dia, Toupa inn ah ni thum nin ka hohtou ding, chih chiamtehna bang ahi dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isai in, Toupa’n a thilgen a hihngei ding chih hiai nang adin Toupa apan chiamtehna ding ahi ding: “Limliap kalbi sawm tan a mailam a a kintouh hia na deih kalbi sawm tan a a nunglam a a kin?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah in a dawng a, “Limliap kalbi sawm tan a malam a kintouh a baihtel a, huaizaw hi kei hen, limliap kalbi sawm tan in nunglam ah nungkik zaw hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei Isai in Toupa a sam a; huchi in Ahaz dakzah theihna a limliap niamsa kalbi sawm tan in nunglam ah a kiksak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailai in Baladan tapa Babulon kumpipa Merodakbaladan in laikhakte leh thilpiakte Hezekiah a khak a; Hezekiah chi a na chih a na zak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in amau a na kipahpih a, a thil manpha koihna inn a thil manpha tengteng, dangka, dangkaeng, gimlimte, sathau manpha, a galvan koihna inn teng leh a gou koihkhawmna inn sung a om tengteng a ensak a: a inn leh a gamsung a Hezekiah in a etsak louh a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huailai in zawlnei Isai kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah a hong a, a kiang ah, “Huai mite’n bang ahia a gen uh? Koi apan na kiang a honghoh ahi ua?” chi’n a dong hi. Hezekiah in, “Gam gamla, Babulon apan hong ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in aman “Na inn ah bangbang ahia a muh uh?” a chi a; Hezekiah in, “Ka insung a om tengteng a muvek ua, ka gou lak ah ka etsak louh a omkei ” chi’n a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isai in Hezekiah kiang ah, “ Toupa thu ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, na insung a om tengteng leh tuni tan a na pi leh pute’n a na kholkhawmte uh Babulon khua ah a paipih nite uh a hongtung ding; Bangmah nutsiat a neikei ding uh Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na gil a gah, na suan ding, na tate ngei leng a paimangpih ding ua; Babulon kumpipa in ah michilgeh ahi ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in Isai kiang ah, “Na gen Toupa thu a hoih ahi” a chi hi. “Ka damsung a lemna leh thutak a om ding nakleh hoih himailou hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah tanchin dangte, a thilhih theihdan tengteng leh dil leh tuilakna a bawl a, khopi sung a tui a laklut thute Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; a tapa Manasseh a sik in a lal hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh a lal pattung in kum sawmlehnih a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh nga a lal a; a nu min Hephzibah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel suante ma a delhkhiaksa namte thil kihhuai tak a hihte uh bang, Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekiah in a hihsiatsa munsangte a dingsak nawn a; Israel kumpipa Ahab hih bang in Baal maitamte a dingsak a, Aserahte a bawl a, van a om tengteng a bia in a na uh a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n “Jerusalem ah ka min ka omsak ding” a chihna Toupa inn ah maitamte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa inn huangsung intual nihte ah van a om tengteng adin maitamte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tapa mei ah a paisuaksak a, aisan leh bum a hih a, dawi zawlte leh kha napeuh a dong hi. Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou thupi mahmah Amah hehsak din a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n David leh a tapa Solomon kiang a, “Hiai inn leh Jerusalem khua, Israel chi tengteng lak a ka tel ah ka min tangtawn in ka omsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka piak tengteng leh ka sikha Mosi in dan a piak tengteng a zuih peuhmah uleh a pi leh pute uh ka piaksa gam apan Israelte khete leng ka kalsuan khesak n’on sam kei ding” a na chih khitsa inn ah Aserah lim bawl in a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh amau a zuikei ua; Toupa’n Israel suante ma a delhkhiaksa namte hih sang tham a thupizaw thil hihkhial din Manasseh in mite a lampial sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n a sikha zawlneite zang in thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Judah kumpipa Manasseh in hiai thil kihhuai takte a hih a, Amorte sang tham in a hihkhial thupi hi. Judahte’n leng a milimte a thil a hih khelhsak ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi. “Ngai dih ua, Jerusalem leh Judah tung ah a za peuhmahte bil langnih khengzou khop a thil hoihlou k’on tungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria tehna khau leh Ahab inkaw ulum khai Jerusalem tung ah ka khung dia; min a kuangnul a kilumletsak bang in Jerusalem ka nul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka goutan omsunte ka taisan dia, a melmate uh khut ah ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in a pi leh pute uh Aigupta gam apan a hongpawt nung uh tuni pha a ka mit muh a thil hoihlou a hih ua, hon hehsak ziak un, a melma tengteng mat ding leh gallak ding ahi ding uh” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou tak hih a Judahte thil a hih khelhsak, khelhna a simlou in Manasseh in poikhoihlou sisan nakpitak in a suah lai a, Jerusalem dung leh vai a dimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasseh tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng, a thilhih khelhte Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Manasseh a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a, Uzza huansung a om amah inn huan mah ah a vui ua; a tapa Ammon a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ammon a lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh nih a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum nih a lal a; a nu min Mesullemeth, Jotbah khua a Haruz tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa Manasseh hih bangmah Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou tak a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pa lampi tot tengteng a tawnsam a, a pa septe milim pathiante na sem in amau a bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa , a pi leh pute Pathian a paisan a, Toupa lampi a tawn kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ammon sikhate’n amah a guksawm ua, kumpipa amah inn ah a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh huai gam a mite’n kumpipa Ammon guksawmmi tengteng a thatvek uhi. Huchi in huai gam mite’n a tapa Josiah a sik in kumpipa in a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Ammon thilhih tanchin dangte Judah kumpipate lal lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uzza huan a amah han ah a vui ua; a tapa Josiah a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah a lal pattung in kum giat a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum leh khat a lal a; a nu min Jedidah, Boskath khua a Adaiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Toupa mitmuh in thildik a hih a, a pu David lampi tot tengteng a tawn a, taklam ah hiam veilam ah hiam a pialkhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah a lal kum sawmlehgiat kum in hichi ahi a, kumpipa’n Mesullam tapa Azaliah tapa Laigelhmi Saphan kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Siampu lianpen Hilkia kiang ah hohtou inla, kongkhak vengmite’n mite apan a na lakkhawm uh Toupa inn a dangka kikoih sim uhenla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa inn lam nasemmite pia uhen; amau in sebawl Toupa inn a nasemte pia uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Singlem bawlmite, inlammite, inn sia bawlmite’n inn siatna tak bawlna sing leh suangsek a lei theihna ding un, chi’n vagen in, chi in Toupa inn ah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh dangka a piakte uh etpih nawn din a gelhsak tuankei, muanhuai tak a hihzel a hih ziak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu lianpen Hilkia in Laigelhmi Saphan kiang ah, “ Toupa inn ah dan laibu ka mu” a chi hi. Hilkia in huai laibu Saphan a pia a, aman a simta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Laigelhmi Saphan kumpipa kiang ah a hoh a, kumpipa kiang ah thu a vatun nawn a, “Na mite’n in a dangka om a pekhe vek ua: Toupa inn lam nasemmite a pevek uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laigelhmi Saphan in, “Siampu Hilkia in laibu a honpia” chi in kumpipa a hilh a, huchi in Saphan in kumpipa ma ah a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa’n dan laibu a thute a zak in hichi ahi a, a puante a botkek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n siampu Hilkia, Saphan tapa Ahikam, Mikaiah tapa Akbor, Laigelhmi Saphan leh kumpipa sikha Asahiah kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kei, mi tengteng leh Judah teng adin hiai laibu a thu tuang toh kisai in Toupa hon dotsak un. I pi leh pute’n hiai laibu a thute zui dia a na ngaihkhiatlouh ziak un i tung uah Toupa thangpaihna a thupi mahmah ngal a” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in siampu Hilkia, Ahikam, Akbor, Saphan, Asahiah, puansilh kempa Harhas tapa Tikvah tapa Sallum zi zawlnei Huldah kiang ah a hoh ua, a va houpih uhi. Amah bel Jerusalem sehkhen nihna a teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. “Ka kiang a nou hon sawlpa hilh un, Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Ngai in, hiai mun ah leh asung a tengte tung ah thil hoihlou k’on tungsak ding, Judah kumpipa’n laibu a, a thusim tengteng bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei a hon paisan ua, pathian dangte kiang ah gimlim a hal ua, a khutsuak ua a hon thangpaihsak ziak un hiai mun ah ka thangpaihna nakpi’n a kuangdia, a mawkmih kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa dongdia nou honsawlpa Judah kumpipa kiang ah huchi in na chi ding uh. Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Na thuzak tungtang thu ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hiai mun leh, asung a tengte hihgam leh hamsiat in a om ding uh chih thu ka gen na zak a, na lungtang a nem a, Toupa ma a na kiniamkhiak a, na puante na bohkeka, ka ma a na kah ziak in, ken leng na thu ka naza, Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in ngai in, na pi leh pute kiang ah k’on pi dia, na han ah lungmuangtaka piin na om dia, hiai mun a thil hoihlou ka tunsak ding tengteng na mit in a muvek kei ding” a chi hi. Huchi in huai thu kumpipa kiang ah a tun nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa’n mi a sawl a, Judah leh Jerusalem khopi a upa tengteng a kiang ah a samkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Judah gam a mi tengteng leh Jerusalem khua a mi tengteng toh, siampute leh zawlneite toh, mipi tengteng toh, a neu a lian in Toupa inn ah a hohtou ua; Toupa inn a kimu thukhun laibu a tuang thu tengteng a bil ua zak in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa khuam zul ah ading a, huai laibu a tuang thukhun thu hihkip din lungtang tengteng leh a kha tengteng a Toupa zui ding leh a thupiakte, a thu theihsakte, a thusehte zui din Toupa ma ah thu a khung a; huchi in mipi tengteng in leng a khunpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n siampu lianpen Hilkia leh a zom a siampute, kongkhak vengmite kiang ah Toupa biakin sung a Baal, Aserah leh van a om tengteng adia kibawl tuium-belsuan tengteng lakhe vek din thu a pia hi. Huchi in Jerusalem pawlam, Kidron mun ah huai tengteng a hal a, a vute Bethel ah a paipih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Milim pathian bia siampute, Judah Kumpipate’n Judah gam khopi munsangte a, Jerusalem kim a gimlim haldia a na seh uh a tawpsak a; Baal adia, ni adia, kha adia, aksite adia van a omte tengteng adia gimlim halmite leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa inn a Aserah pen Jerusalem pawlam Kidron lui a lakhia in a hal a, a siknen gawp a, a nen mi vantangte han ah a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aserah puangan numeite omna, Toupa inn kiang a pasal kizuakte omna innte a phelkhe vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah khopi apan siampu tengteng a pikhia a, siampute’n gimlim a halna uh Geba apan Beer–sheba pha in a hihbuah vek a; khopi kongpi a veilam pang a om khopi ukpa Joshua kongpi ah a lut a kongpite a munsangte a chimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Munsang siampute Jerusalem a Toupa maitam ah a hohtou kei ua, himahleh a unaute uh lak ah tanghou silngou sohlouh a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuamah in a tapa hiam, a tanu hiam Molech kiang ah mei a paisuaksak nawnlouhna din, Hinnom suante guam a Tophet a hihbuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa inn lutna a inn huangsung a kumpipa inn vengmi Nathanmelek dantan chin a Judah Kumpipate’n ni adia sakol a piakte uh a lamang vek a; ni kangtalai mei in a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz inn chial tung a Judah Kumpipate’n maitam a bawlte uh leh Manasseh in Toupa inn huangsung intual nih a maitam a bawlte kumpipa’n a hihchim a, a hihnen vek a, a nente Kidron lui ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem ma a tatsiatna tang taklam pang a Zidonte pathian kihhuai mahmah Astoreth adia, Ammon suante pathian kihhuai mahmah Khemosh adia, Ammonte Pathian kihhuai mah Molech Israel kumpipa Solomon in munsang a bawlte kumpipa’n a hihbuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Milimte a kitam gawpsak vek a, Ashera a hihpuk a, huai munte ah mihing guhte a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huailou leng Israelte thil hihkhial sakpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam in Bethel a maitam leh Israelte thil hihkhial sakpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam in a bawl munsang, huai maitam a hihchim a munsang mei a hal in a sikzan a, Ashera a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josiah a kihei a, tang a hante a mu a; huchi in han a guhte a va lasak a, huai thu Pathian min a na gen, Toupa thu bangbang in maitam tung ah a hal a, a hihbuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in aman, huai a ka muh kua suangphuh ahia? a chi a; khomite’n, Pathian mi, Judah gam apan hongpai, Bethel a maitam tung a tua na hih a na genkholpa han eive, chi in a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman “Bangmah chih kei un; kuamah in a guhte lasuan kei hen” a chi hi. Huchi in a guhte Samaria gam apan zawlnei hong paipa guhte toh bangmah a chih kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel Kumpipate’n Toupa hehsak dia a lam uh Samaria gam khua a mun sang in tengteng leng Josiah in a suanmang a, Bethel a ahihvek bang geih in a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in huai a munsang siampu tengteng maitam tung ah a that a, huaite ah mihing guhte a hal a, Jerusalem ah a kiknawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mi tengteng kiang ah, “Hiai thukhun bu a tuang bang in Toupa , Pathian adin Paikan Ankuang zang un” chi’n, thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israelte tung a vaihawmmite’n vai a hawm ua kipan Israel kumpipa tengteng, Judah kumpipate lal sung teng in huchibang hial Paikan Ankuang a zangngei naikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah lal kum sawmlehgiatna kum in Paikan Ankuang Jerusalem khua ah Toupa adin hiai bang in a nei phet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai ban ah Toupa inn a siampu Hilkia in a muh laibu a thu tuangte a kipsak theihna din dawi aisansiam zawlte, bumsiamte, pathian limte, Judah gam leh Jerusalem a thil kihhuai a muh tengteng Josiah in a hihmang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi dan tengteng a lungtang leh kha tengteng leh hatna tengteng a Toupa pom amah bang mahmah a ma a kumpipate kuamah a omkei ua; a nung in leng amah bang kuamah a om n’on sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchipi in leng Toupa’n a thangpaihna thupi mahmah, Manasseh in a na thangpaihsakna tengteng ziak in Judah tung a a thangpaihna a kihei san kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n , “Israel ka suanmang bang in Judah leng ka muh phak louhna ah ka suanmang sam dia, hiai khua ka tel Jerusalem ngei leh huai a inn ka min a omna ding, ka chih ka paimang ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Josiah tanchin dangte, a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai tanchingelhnabu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amah a lal lai in Aigupta kumpipa Pharo Neko Assuria kumpipa dou din Euphrates lui ah a hohtou hi. Kumpipa Josiah in amah a na dou a; aman a muhtak in Meggiddo khua ah a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in a sikhate’n Meggiddo apan a luang kangtalai in a paipih ua, Jerusalem ah a lutpih ua, amah han ah a vui uh. Huchi in huai gam a mite’n Josiah tapa Jehoahaz a pi ua, thau a nilh ua, a pa sik in kumpipa in a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz a lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh thum a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kha thum sung a lal a; a nu min Hemutal, Libnah khua a Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pi leh pute hih bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pharo Neko in Jerusalem a vaihawm thei nawnlou din Hamath gam a Riblah khua ah a koltang sak a; a gam uh dangka talent za khat leh dangkaeng talent khat siah a kipe sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharo Neko in Josiah tapa Eliakim, a pa Josiah sik in a lal sak a, a min Jehoiakim chi in a kheksak hi. Jehoahaz bel a pimang a; Aigupta gam ah a pai a, huai ah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehoiakim in dangka leh dangkaeng Pharo a pe phot a; himahleh a ma gam Pharo thupiak bang in dangka adin siah a liausak hi. Pharo Neko kiang a piak din michih liau dia a sehzah chiat bang in huai gam a mite dangka leh dangkaeng a liausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakim a lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehkhat a lal a; a nu min Zebudah, Rumah khua a Pedaiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in a pi leh pute hihdan bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lal lai in Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in huai gam a hongdou a, Jehoiakim bel a sikha in kum thum a om hi. Huai nung in a lehngatsan a, a tung ah a helta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Kaldai pawlte, Suria pawlte, Moab pawlte, Ammon suan pawlte amah sual din a sawlkhia a, a sikha zawlneite zang a a gen Toupa thu bang in Judah gam hihse sak din a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh khelhna, a thilhih tengteng ziak a, a muh phak louhna a amaute suanmang din, Judah tung ah Toupa thupiak a hongtung petmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midik sisan a suah ziak in leng; midik sisan a Jerusalem a hih dim ziak in leng Toupa’n amah a ngaidam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoiakim tanchin dang leh a thilhih tengteng Judah kumpipate lal lai tanchin gelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoiakim bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmuta a; a tapa Jehoiakin a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa a gam apan a hong kuan khe nawn kei hi. Babulon kumpipa’n Aigupta gam lui apan Euphrates lui pha a kumpipa gam huap tengteng a lak zoh tak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakin bel a lal pat tung in kum sawmlehgiat a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kha thum a lal a a nu min Nehushta, Jerusalem khua a Elnathan tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pa hih dan tengteng hih in, Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchihlai in Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar sikhate Jerusalem ah a hohtou ua, khua a va um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi a a sikhate’n a va umlai un Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khua ah a va hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Judah kumpipa Jehoiakin, a nu, a sikhate, a miliante, a heutute toh Babulon kumpipa kiang ah a va pawtkhia ua; a lal kum giat kum in Babulon kumpipa’n a na man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa gen bang in, a in a gou tengteng leh kumpipa inn a gou tengteng a lavek a, Toupa biakin a Israelte kumpipa Solomon in dangkaeng tuium-belsuan a bawl tengteng a satgawp vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem a mi tengteng, milian tengteng, mihat hangsan hoih tengteng, sing khat leh khutsiam leh siksekmi tengteng sal in a pivek hi. Huai gam a mi gentheite chihlouh kuamah a omta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiakin bel Babulon ah a pi a; kumpipa nu, kumpinute, a heutute leh huai gam a mihatte Jerusalem apan Babulon ah sal in a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa’n pasal hoih tengteng sang sagih leh khutsiam leh siksekmi sang khat, mi hat hoih teng galdou thei mi ngen Babulon ah sal in a pi vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pa unaupa Mattaniah, Babulon kumpipa’n a sik in a lal sak a, a min Zedekiah chi in a kheksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah bel a lal pattung in kum sawmnih leh khat a upa ahi. Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehkhat sung a lal a; a nu min Hamutal, Libnah khua a Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehoiakim hihdan tengteng bang in a hih a, Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou mahmah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa hehna tawn in Jerusalem leh Judah tung ah Zedekiah Babulon kumpipa tung a a hel apan Aman a muh phaklouh dia a paihmang masiah hiai thilte a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lal kum kua kum, kha sawmna, ni sawm ni tak in hichi ahi a, a sepaih tengteng toh Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar hong kuan in Jerusalem a hong dou a, om mun a vabawl a; kulh in a umsuakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi in kumpipa Zedekiah lal kum sawmlehkhatna tan in khua um in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kha lina, ni kua nin khua a kial mahmahta a, huai gam mite adin tanghou a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khopi kulh a hihvang ua, zan in galdou thei mi tengteng kumpipa huan ning, kulh bang nih kikal a kulh kongpi ah a taikhe vek ua; Kaldaite’n khua a umsuak uhi; kumpipa Arabah lampi ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Kaldai sepaihte’n kumpipa a delh ua, Jeriko phaizang ah a pha ua; a sepaih tengteng in amah taizak sanvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a man ua, Babulon kumpipa kiang ah Riblah khua ah a pi ua; a tungtang thu a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah tapate a mitmuh ngei in a that ua, Zedekiah mitte a khelkhiak sak ua, kol a bunsak ua, Babulon ah a paipihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Babulon kumpipa, kumpipa Nebukadnezzar lal kum sawmlehkua na, kha ngana, ni sagih ni’n Babulon kumpipa vengmi pawl heutu Nebuzaradan Jerusalem ah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a hal a; Jerusalem inn tengteng, inn thupi taktakte a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vengmi pawl heutu kiang a om Kaldai sepaih tengteng in Jerusalem kim a kulhte a hihchim vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khopi sung a nutsiat a om mite, Babulon kumpipa kiang a kipia mite leh mipi dang teng vengmi pawl heutu Nebuzaradan in sal in a pi vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai gam a a genthei tatate lak a mite vengmi pawl heutu in grepgui kem ding leh loubawl din a nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa inn a dalkhuamte leh a tunnate leh dal limlang tuipi Kaldaite’n a hihkek gawpvek ua, a dal Babulon ah a paipih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belte, vut luahnate, khawnvak puan tehnate, keute leh dal tuium-belsuan tengteng, nasepna dia a zatte uh a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Meilaknate, belkuangte toh, vengmi pawl heutu in dangkaeng a bawlte bel a dangkaeng a la a, dangka sik a bawlte a dangka a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa inn adia a bawl khuampi nih, tuikuangpi khat leh a tunnate leh hiai vanzat tengteng bawlna dal buk theihvual ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuam khat sandan tong sawmlehgiat ahi a, a dawn ah dal sunbawk a om a; huai sunbawk sandan tong thum ahi. Sunbawk kim ah gial tiktek leh theibuhfai a tuang a, dal a bawlvek ahi uh. Huchi mah bang in khuampi khat leng a gial tiktek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vengmi pawl heutu in siampu lian Seraiah leh a zompa siampu Zephaniah leh kongkhak vengmi thum a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Galdou thei mite tung a heutu khat toh, kumpipa kiang a om khopi tung a omlai ngate toh, mipite min gelhpa sepaihte heutu Laigelhmi toh, khopi sung a omlai gam a mi sawmguk toh khopi sung apan a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vengmi pawl heutu Nebuzaradan in amau a pi a, Babulon kumpipa kiang ah Riblah khua ah a paipih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa’n Hamath gam, Riblah khua ah amau a na that hi. Huchi in Judah, a gamsung apan sal a pikhiak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in Judah gam a a nutsiat teng tung ah Saphan tapa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah ukpa din a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in sepaih pawl heutu tengteng leh a heute’n Babulon kumpipa’n Gedaliah ukpa in a bawl chih a zak un Mizpah khua ah Gedaliah kiang ah a hoh ua, huaite bel Nathaniah tapa Ishmael, Kareah tapa Johanan, Netophath mi Tanhumeth tapa Seraiah, Mak mi tapa Jaazaniah leh a heute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gedaliah huai mite leh a heute uh kiang ah a kichiam a, a kiang uah, “Kaldaite sikha a om lau kei un. Hiai gam ah teng unla, Babulon kumpipa na sem un, huchi in nou adin a hoih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh a kha sagihna ah hichi ahi a, kumpipa suan Elishama tapa, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael bel mi sawm toh a hong kuan a, Mizpah khua a Judami leh Kaldaimi a kiang a omteng leh Gedaliah a hongsual ua, a that vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in mi tengteng a lian a neu in sepaih heutute toh a pawtkhia ua, Kaldaite a lauh ziak un Aigupta gam ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoiakin saltan kum sawmthum leh sagih na, kha sawmlehnih na, ni sawmnih leh sagih ni’n hichi ahi a, Babulon kumpipa Evil Merodak in a lal pattung kum in Judah kumpipa Jehoiakin a tanna in apan a khahkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kiang ah hoihtak in thu a gen a, Babulon a kumpipa om samte mangtutphah tung ah a mangtutphah a koihsang tuamse hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tanna in puansilhte a kheng a, a damsung teng in a kiang ah an a ne gige samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in a loh ding, kumpipa’n a piak tatlaklou a om a, a damsung teng in, niteng a a zat ding a bawlsak gige hi.
  </para>
</usx>
